:"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ofajs/ofa.js/commits/7fd1d816acdb8875d4ec8c9028a7ef9845fc619a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:58:13Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T12:58:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: update skill (#252)\n\n* docs: add docs about built-in reserved name collision for page module\n\n补充了 ofa.js 页面模块的 proto 和 data 禁止与内置保留名重名的相关文档，包括中文和英文文档，新增了详细示例和报错说明，提醒开发者避免使用back、goto等内置方法和属性名，防止页面注册失败。\n\n* Update SKILL.md\n\n* docs: 补充ofa.js指令值和页面缓存的常见问题说明\n\n新增两个详细开发常见问题的说明文档：\n1. 指令值使用JS表达式的规则，裸保留字/未加引号的字面量会触发语法错误\n2. 页面模块缓存导致代码修改不生效的问题和解决办法\n\n* docs: add usage note for $host/$data in ofa.js templates\n\n补充了 o-fill 组件作用域内和根级模板中 $host/$data 的正确使用方式，说明根级不能使用这两个变量并给出排查口诀，同时提供了中英双语的示例和错误写法说明\n\n* chore: build skill\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"75446dd026333cf6f59023b056bf2e1160fb009d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ofajs/ofa.js/git/trees/75446dd026333cf6f59023b056bf2e1160fb009d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ofajs/ofa.js/git/commits/7fd1d816acdb8875d4ec8c9028a7ef9845fc619a","verification":{"payload":"tree 75446dd026333cf6f59023b056bf2e1160fb009d\nparent 61429e88479470e8c6523f270f29df95a59944c0\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787057893 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787057893 +0800\n\nfeat: update skill (#252)\n\n* docs: add docs about built-in reserved name collision for page module\n\n补充了 ofa.js 页面模块的 proto 和 data 禁止与内置保留名重名的相关文档，包括中文和英文文档，新增了详细示例和报错说明，提醒开发者避免使用back、goto等内置方法和属性名，防止页面注册失败。\n\n* Update SKILL.md\n\n* docs: 补充ofa.js指令值和页面缓存的常见问题说明\n\n新增两个详细开发常见问题的说明文档：\n1. 指令值使用JS表达式的规则，裸保留字/未加引号的字面量会触发语法错误\n2. 页面模块缓存导致代码修改不生效的问题和解决办法\n\n* docs: add usage note for $host/$data in ofa.js templates\n\n补充了 o-fill 组件作用域内和根级模板中 $host/$data 的正确使用方式，说明根级不能使用这两个变量并给出排查口诀，同时提供了中英双语的示例和错误写法说明\n\n* chore: build skill\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhFblCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeu0QAE2MqadKzp5O8EBG67DzkWQj\n2RwFSJvHgJh1jatpvFsxJg4LJ2nCFY9L+mW1fj08NN/tPof+9rdqG0aZwb5lhkEB\nU4tGEId3hZlmKLoNkdPySqu7Ip1UB1ADuNFOZCnTr/ZPxX7qhK+UQ2MuTg4k5qzB\nxDUQGd3mzt7wrGGz3qNQWVF5SQFLzzuV0wzh4vwLTzDJFQOtPDcB7NJV9YWrsfyp\njjBzInz5IgXQktQCNYJFVTJP/yuMWcX1koqebSAGsUuNu+dpzimGFWzzk2uCRiqw\nOV9dEXzXzwtEtXYCwmeuwdBLo1EEVSHmMh6zNOhZS/02G1ejHm8SdG7RllWp69GF\n1jRlJuzprlFO/93UpDwL4KQt9Ovnh8bD2r24wh8bs6B/0IA9psHHravOI8mTc9dP\nK5EzxeeVJKqJPDYPoH7NM0JjLxdOwALAUrz1bHosW2661POrEOv8lmcz5EyTe0Aw\nslZyOS0/oqgS2g+N/UlHBFSciHObrq1AwTDzwMY0TG9YZofHNLm7BLodmYWI3/kb\nRLGCudZ3dLUebrlLRyPrpG/0iLZsprXOLR+oJhqQxZIS6Tjh4PitAEnXVlMC+n2l\nVaqDOMS1hNt/ODIue9trTeZ53p4YVZ8HY2iYbNLPIPMi3GCcyKnE+kWAotn6yuy0\nbwVjGOo4VUgv+ZBZwqIO\n=LMKc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T12:58:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3"