":"Matti Airas"},"message":"fix(signalk): harden metadata serialization\n\nRequire an explicit zone lower bound so an accidentally unbounded\nzone no longer compiles; omit empty zone messages so the server\ndefault applies; drop the unreachable switch default so a future\nalarm state triggers -Wswitch; use default member initializers for\nthe displayScale sentinels; make alarm_state_to_string protected\nfor the documented subclassing path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7546c26e0de10e8f3a04ad4750981e44329cdb30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/7546c26e0de10e8f3a04ad4750981e44329cdb30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/fb5bf0a43c94183cae73a837b98d4d999d7afcca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/fb5bf0a43c94183cae73a837b98d4d999d7afcca","node_id":"C_kwDOC0IfMdoAKGZiNWJmMGE0M2M5NDE4M2NhZTczYTgzN2I5OGQ0ZDk5OWQ3YWZjY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"htt