 no spare value for the sentinel design, so Nullable<bool> was\nforbidden by a static_assert (#883): false was indistinguishable from\ninvalid. Add an explicit flag-based specialization -- true, false, and\ninvalid are all distinct -- leaving the primary template and every numeric\nsentinel specialization unchanged, so non-bool behaviour (and the NMEA 2000\nmissing-data wire mapping) is byte-for-byte identical.\n\nRefs #883\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"683d7387e58bf59ef596d7cb9b77e0fd808208de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/683d7387e58bf59ef596d7cb9b77e0fd808208de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/e59604cf4b3838787b8dd7c7f29dbbcc316a770d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/e59604cf4b3838787b8dd7c7f29dbbcc316a770d","node_id":"C_kwDOC0IfMdoAKGU1OTYwNGNmNGIzODM4Nzg3YjhkZDdjN2YyOWRiYmNjMzE2YTc3MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https