as"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T18:25:31Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"docs(sensors): explain DigitalInputDebounceCounter config-load ordering\n\nDocument why LoadConfig exists and why the debounce counter calls load() from\nits own constructor body: load() invokes the virtual from_json(), so loading\nfrom a base constructor dispatches to the base override and silently drops\nignore_interval. Without this rationale an innocent cleanup could reintroduce\nthe bug.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb9a2dc0b8f476cf84297a08d37f115e748775e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/bb9a2dc0b8f476cf84297a08d37f115e748775e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/ade30ad24375ac4e0860b84dd1375c70ad173ba6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/ade30ad24375ac4e0860b84dd1375c70ad173ba6","node_id":"