,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/7f3e98045c67cb5b4f9f9f3e4c37f0006826eb2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:23:28Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:23:28Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"perf(signalk): allocate TOFU PEM buffer on demand\n\ncert_to_pem() used a function-static 4096-byte buffer, occupying ~4 KB of\n.bss for the device''s whole uptime although TOFU CA capture only runs\nduring the TLS handshake. Allocate it on the heap scoped to the call and\nfree it on return. It stays off the small TLS task stack (the original\nreason for the static buffer), and the size is kept fixed at 4096 rather\nthan derived from the DER length, since PEM is always larger than its DER\ninput. Allocation failure fails safe to \"no usable CA\", matching the\nexisting encode-error contract.\n\nRefs SignalK/SensESP#1036\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8759565c2be5a4be18fcb3205e5a6ded3ff6215e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/8759565c2be5a4be18fcb3205e5a6ded3ff6215e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/7f3e98045c67cb5b4f9f9f3e4c37f0006826eb2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/7f3e98045c67cb5b4f9f9f3e4c37f0006826eb2a","node_id":"C_kwDOC0IfMdoAKDdmM2U5ODA0NWM2N2NiNWI0ZjlmOWYzZTRjMzdmMDAwNjgyNmViMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9","sha":"9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9"}],"sha":"7f3e98045c67cb5b4f9f9f3e4c37f0006826eb2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/7f3e98045c67cb5b4f9f9f3e4c37f0006826eb2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/1a8b7f0b2d4863a67bac841e454764e4f1f3d10a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:23:28Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:23:28Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"perf(system): reduce LogBuffer RAM footprint\n\nTwo heap reductions in the log capture path:\n\n- kLogCaptureQueueDepth 16 -> 8: the vprintf-hook-to-capture-task handoff\n  queue is allocated unconditionally in install() (~264 B/slot), held for\n  the whole uptime even if /api/log is never opened. ~2.1 KB persistent.\n  The handoff is already non-blocking drop-on-full, so a shallower queue\n  only raises the burst-drop rate.\n\n- LogBuffer default max_lines 200 -> 100: records_ can hold up to max_lines\n  heap std::strings during a verbose connect/TLS burst. The 2 s age cap\n  keeps steady-state low, so this trims the peak during the heap-pressure\n  window. The web log is a ~2 s live tail, not scrollback.\n\nRefs SignalK/SensESP#1036\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd94a607f4998d55517ff72bc440c2998df4dbc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/cd94a607f4998d55517ff72bc440c2998df4dbc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/1a8b7f0b2d4863a67bac841e454764e4f1f3d10a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/1a8b7f0b2d4863a67bac841e454764e4f1f3d10a","node_id":"C_kwDOC0IfMdoAKDFhOGI3ZjBiMmQ0ODYzYTY3YmFjODQxZTQ1NDc2NGU0ZjFmM2QxMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/SensESP/commit/9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9","sha":"9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/9e0bbea7ad1a93c642946ff286043b7eb48733d9"}],"sha":"1a8b7f0b2d4863a67bac841e454764e4f1f3d10a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/1a8b7f0b2d4863a67bac841e454764e4f1f3d10a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/