,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mairas","id":407010,"login":"mairas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mairas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/commits/397671ada89b7dfd1795da00d10048666e342a90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:55:06Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T13:55:06Z","email":"matti.airas@hatlabs.fi","name":"Matti Airas"},"message":"fix(signalk): re-arm metadata when the first delta send fails\n\nget_deltas() builds one-shot metadata (units, zones, displayName) into the\nfirst delta and marks it sent before the send happens. With the non-blocking\n0-tick send, that first send can fail under brief ws-client lock contention or\ntransport backpressure; the rest of the batch is dropped but the connection\nstays up, so metadata is never re-emitted until the next reconnect. Re-arm\nmetadata when the first delta -- the only one that can carry it -- fails to send.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bc92a5587d1534096025d3ca9a2040933641053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/trees/2bc92a5587d1534096025d3ca9a2040933641053"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/SensESP/git/commits/397671ada89b7dfd1795da00d10048666e342a90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407010?v=4","events_url":"https://a