:{"date":"2026-07-24T17:43:04Z","email":"unadlib@gmail.com","name":"unadlib"},"message":"feat(core): compose a Host from application module loaders\n\nAdd createModuleHost() for delivery a bundler has already resolved. An\n`apps` map of module loaders synthesizes the static resolver and the\napplication loader that a shell previously had to assemble by hand, and\nreturns the same typed HostComposition the framework bindings accept.\n\nProps contracts are inferred from each application''s own defineApp\ndeclaration, so importing a module directly leaves no second copy of the\ncontract to keep in sync. The shortcut owns no runtime deployment policy:\na module map has already made that decision at build time. Everything\nbelow the composition root is untouched.","tree":{"sha":"4077bd10cc8b5861995f1b6beaa3c3654197ef87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unadlib/fronts/git/trees/4077bd10cc8b5861995f1b6beaa3c3654197ef87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/unadlib/fronts/git/commits/34e4af4da234296a361e6d26ca51490cd2949d3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18650460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unadlib","id":18650460,"login":"unadlib","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjUwNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unadlib/subscriptions","type":"Us