nternal","name":"Ubuntu"},"message":"Release 4.0.0-TR10","tree":{"sha":"2a707396c82bf0eed6702c40cc99236c30ea939e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/2a707396c82bf0eed6702c40cc99236c30ea939e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/70e25a8ea001c49874ff49d134013bf64b15efd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/70e25a8ea001c49874ff49d134013bf64b15efd0","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDcwZTI1YThlYTAwMWM0OTg3NGZmNDlkMTM0MDEzYmY2NGIxNWVmZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08","sha":"9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08"}],"sha":"70e25a8ea001c49874ff49d134013bf64b15efd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/70e25a8ea001c49874ff49d134013bf64b15efd0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:29:41Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:27:42Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-15389: Fix out-of-sync node stroke color\n\n## What\n- Update the `.node.other` CSS class to use the correct border color for out-of-sync nodes by pointing `stroke` to `--gw-cluster-node-outofsync-border-color`.\n\n## Why\n- After token updates, the border color and background were the same white color\n\n## How\n- Changed the `stroke` property in the `.node.other` CSS class to reference the correct CSS variable for the border color.","tree":{"sha":"4c69249bd9fe72cd76ce9b9220ca467b4f768256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/4c69249bd9fe72cd76ce9b9220ca467b4f768256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDllMDNmMWIzYWQxNWIyZWNlOGU3ZDQwY2Y0YmNjMmYwYWE0NTJiMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6","sha":"d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6"}],"sha":"9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/9e03f1b3ad15b2ece8e7d40cf4bcc2f0aa452b08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25177016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brankovanov","id":25177016,"login":"Brankovanov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTc3MDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:54:01Z","email":"georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com","name":"Georgi Brankovanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:54:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-15374: Warning toastr has no background (#3293)\n\nGDB-15374: Warning toastr has no background\n\n## What\n\nThe warning state of the toastr component lost its colors and is\nrendered\ntransparent, because the color CSS variables were renamed in the design\nsystem.\n\n## Why\n\nThe variables used by the warning state were renamed:\n\n--gw-toast-warn-color -> --gw-toast-warninging-color\n--gw-toast-warn-background -> --gw-toast-warning-background\n--gw-toast-warn-border-color -> --gw-toast-warning-border-color\n\n`onto-toastr.scss`, `bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css`, `owlim-workbech.less`\nstill referenced the old names, so they resolved to nothing.\n\n## How\n\nUpdated the warning-state rules in `onto-toastr.scss`,\n`bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css`, `owlim-workbech.less` to use the new\nvariable\nnames listed above.\n\nAlso updating the relevant styles for the toastr component in\nowlim-workbench.less and bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css\n\n## Testing\n\n-  [x] Workbench build completes without errors.\n- [x] Warning toastr shows the correct text color, background and border\nin the light theme.\n- [x] Warning toastr shows the correct colors in the dark theme.\n- [x] Switching between light and dark themes updates the colors\ncorrectly.\n- [x] Success, info and error toastr states are unaffected.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"ec16779b6d41030bd59b9f0f474c72297549e6e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/ec16779b6d41030bd59b9f0f474c72297549e6e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6","verification":{"payload":"tree ec16779b6d41030bd59b9f0f474c72297549e6e0\nparent e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a\nauthor Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com> 1791453241 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453241 +0000\n\nGDB-15374: Warning toastr has no background (#3293)\n\nGDB-15374: Warning toastr has no background\n\n## What\n\nThe warning state of the toastr component lost its colors and is\nrendered\ntransparent, because the color CSS variables were renamed in the design\nsystem.\n\n## Why\n\nThe variables used by the warning state were renamed:\n\n--gw-toast-warn-color -> --gw-toast-warninging-color\n--gw-toast-warn-background -> --gw-toast-warning-background\n--gw-toast-warn-border-color -> --gw-toast-warning-border-color\n\n`onto-toastr.scss`, `bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css`, `owlim-workbech.less`\nstill referenced the old names, so they resolved to nothing.\n\n## How\n\nUpdated the warning-state rules in `onto-toastr.scss`,\n`bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css`, `owlim-workbech.less` to use the new\nvariable\nnames listed above.\n\nAlso updating the relevant styles for the toastr component in\nowlim-workbench.less and bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css\n\n## Testing\n\n-  [x] Workbench build completes without errors.\n- [x] Warning toastr shows the correct text color, background and border\nin the light theme.\n- [x] Warning toastr shows the correct colors in the dark theme.\n- [x] Switching between light and dark themes updates the colors\ncorrectly.\n- [x] Success, info and error toastr states are unaffected.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2g5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoHcQAASqPBWviKBDoRefXwSFZgQm\nFwnev6LxPexPPpIJpLgs1H2c+eZ5ee6wd1JDy123nRvDM0t7qA+uYKQBkMBGGOAv\nXVbH59ux5V5IFAawAanV0NykZRRL2BEPsSsmihypt4lc9ATasdmEzlR9iqSFLZ9o\n72+LgU+4diAdxFOjiLsMgn77pej43DEgQuMgFNRBp1nUQif5JtR7pToVvT1dfIzc\nDkGKrqqc9WO5sgXUo4KM7o/cyrswbCD3Lfl1lIoccEeKcyHp2DpgMaX/tm7vQgpv\nJ+6Xyk1d6kdDLJ0LFCbwpyY+tsl7PQJWHn2Ywln58i6X9X0GF3lqXvE7g+lCX7Z9\nbF1SpEJxqA9MVfof6xzLn29CEwX5QWOhuNI1G7Zca/JXaRleOHz9tSRujsFyXDa5\nslAn1FJZWlsxrJAcA1A1zNpN0udM6J1Sn2xtB3eqnCB9Bm7xpyfg0KSa+V7Nf9iZ\n0j3x0mbdbl8l5lHjytlTVTNyA/b6dnoQzb9EIkzj/840DDTKtoU3c0CguCmT9gE1\nP+4Hub9hrJZLxz0C1et/ZyoaNvzeA88+kvgQFJ8WGGSAXc2zhQ5iAtw/w2R8t0mo\nwmZAlDuIJZc2n3cZLtr2NoKp7yaK2LweoYJiUtf//Dy8l2ndDDG7mJzOjbgNyLim\nQiLfw1Zi3QJohhw/BhO0\n=WSFf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:54:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGQyY2YxMzg5MTI4OTA2NzllODQ1ZmFiN2Q4YmFjOGNmZmZmZmQyZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a","sha":"e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a"}],"sha":"d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d2cf138912890679e845fab7d8bac8cfffffd2d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25177016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brankovanov","id":25177016,"login":"Brankovanov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTc3MDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:24:53Z","email":"georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com","name":"Georgi Brankovanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:24:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-15384: Explain plan light theme comment color is very light (#3291)\n\nGDB-15384: Explain plan light theme comment color is very light\n\n## What\n\nThe override of the comment color in the \"Query explain plan\" section\napplies to both the dark and light themes, which makes comments hard to\nread in the light theme.\n\n## Why\n\nThe overrides of the comment color in the \"Query explain plan\" section\n(yasr-styles.css and _yasr-styles.scss) are general, set directly on the\n.cm-comment class. They therefore apply to both themes, and the override\ncolor is too light on the light theme.\n\n## How\n\nAdded a condition to the override styles so they apply only when the\nparent container does not have the .cm-s-default class (its presence\nindicates the light theme is selected). As a result, the light theme\nuses CodeMirror''s default comment color (#a50), while the dark theme\nkeeps the override (--gw-neutral-300 - #6b7280).\n\n## Testing\n\n* [x] Workbench build completes without errors.\n* [x] In the light theme, comments in the \"Query explain plan\" section\nare clearly readable.\n* [x] In the dark theme, comments keep the overridden color as before.\n* [x] Switching between light and dark themes updates the comment color\ncorrectly.\n* [x] Comments in other YASR/CodeMirror editors are not affected.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<img width=\"2592\" height=\"971\"\nalt=\"GDB-15384-explain-plan-light-theme-comment-color-is-very-light\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87e9bc38-b31f-4546-a632-2ac87b784b62\"\n/>\n\n## Checklist\n\n* [x] Branch name\n* [x] Target branch\n* [x] Commit messages\n* [x] Squash commits\n* [x] MR name\n* [x] MR description\n* [ ] Tests\n* [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"b1e741a6469740dcded1478f59ea6ad7bdd5e8bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/b1e741a6469740dcded1478f59ea6ad7bdd5e8bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/e0b8247933dfd044541f64deb74ca0ed062b319a","verification":{"payload":"tree b1e741a6469740dcded1478f59ea6ad7bdd5e8bd\nparent 87e3e92b7d97d336e4cab1e3d6819b57ec3921b1\nauthor Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com> 1791447893 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791447893 +0000\n\nGDB-15384: Explain plan light theme comment color is very light (#3291)\n\nGDB-15384: Explain plan light theme comment color is very light\n\n## What\n\nThe override of the comment color in the \"Query explain plan\" section\napplies to both the dark and light themes, which makes comments hard to\nread in the light theme.\n\n## Why\n\nThe overrides of the comment color in the \"Query explain plan\" section\n(yasr-styles.css and _yasr-styles.scss) are general, set directly on the\n.cm-comment class. They therefore apply to both themes, and the override\ncolor is too light on the light theme.\n\n## How\n\nAdded a condition to the override styles so they apply only when the\nparent container does not have the .cm-s-default class (its presence\nindicates the light theme is selected). As a result, the light theme\nuses CodeMirror''s default comment color (#a50), while the dark theme\nkeeps the override (--gw-neutral-300 - #6b7280).\n\n## Testing\n\n* [x] Workbench build completes without errors.\n* [x] In the light theme, comments in the \"Query explain plan\" section\nare clearly readable.\n* [x] In the dark theme, comments keep the overridden color as before.\n* [x] Switching between light and dark themes updates the comment color\ncorrectly.\n* [x] Comments in other YASR/CodeMirror editors are not affected.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<img width=\"2592\" height=\"971\"\nalt=\"GDB-15384-explain-plan-light-theme-comment-color-is-very-light\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87e9bc38-b31f-4546-a632-2ac87b784b62\"\n/>\n\n## Checklist\n\n* [x] Branch name\n* [x] Target branch\n* [x] Commit messages\n* [x] Squash commits\n* [x] MR name\n* [x] MR description\n* [ ] Tests\n* [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1NVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWQEQACJxF7OHLCJBF6ASey3XWkrL\nI0jaXqlGdsc92PjNEfeLeKx0ExsZJYXamhRA9pSqbtMbiFkMDGX3WkvQHjM9nGsC\nRhkS5TmXo1KFQ8c3OiW7J6+KJF0zIsSwOD4ZCTvz0Qou+d3829/e1JOMVWNvSGN4\nBcpA5B2bpPqlrC6gMvaklPMEg6Xznbmb2TI1CjmJinAFtPXpRQcagZB4KfCArMj8\nxGmQU8TpR0yagnWRHLKwpz7TujlZm4jxrDm/lrbW/yfE2iPmZPA6f86CrVxBABn+\nQvq1+yn5SQQk06QACjl9wWc1V5JFVWjxdu5VsTiNL4LvNjP6QYhhAsjYgAd3M4pE\nWETB5PXKj1lIqVizmv80ST5jfjqy5xtrZdiGlIcgNnBVPiSIBWJHf6dP3ymE7q/P\nQTLUJYES7n4mDILEY9fPPZuy7+arNc06jd0tBNF77+EKEk50wrRzQ4AEbCkyStyQ\ntlORS8ER1Pu6WDOIsaP5Tt6zfqpvkVC5zrwe6dKrY78mtVdMHOVQxqpeYHUWPfko\nF+MmS1OHVxF5UoRvx6mq1jp5iMJh5McGD6YmuuE1Lu+WP4XENtow1Oq9A68medUE\nmq3Y1BG2ff8puT88A9zJyM/OMpu0B5y6KNJCQVYCkbrNtYrP+VEYgwZPE0HZ7sm2\nk/N86SuK5bBdqXNSXr0y\n=bVOk\n-----END PGP SIGN