-workbench/commit/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982","sha":"e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982"}],"sha":"b1d0749069475f20ada702da696db6daae39a652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/b1d0749069475f20ada702da696db6daae39a652"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:20:07Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:38:32Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-14197: Centralize the RDF 1.2 version in Accept headers\n\n## What\nRequest RDF 1.2 through a single `RdfVersionUtil.withVersion()` helper\nexported from `@ontotext/workbench-api`, instead of hand-appending\n`;version=1.2` to Accept headers across REST services, controllers and\ncomponents.\n\n## Why\nThe approach from GDB-14206 was fragile and partly ineffective:\n- In multi-value headers (SPARQL editor, similarity) the parameter\n  ended up only on the last media range and after `q`, where it is not\n  a media type parameter. The preferred result formats were never\n  versioned.\n- `accept || ''application/json'' + '';version=1.2''` versioned only the\n  default value because of operator precedence.\n- `accept + '';version=1.2''` produced `undefined;version=1.2` for a\n  missing value.\n- The version was added in REST services in some places and in\n  business logic in others, so nothing prevented double appending.\n\n## How\n- `withVersion()` adds `version=1.2` to every media range, before `q`.\n  It is idempotent, leaves empty values and `application/json` as they\n  are, and keeps `text/plain` versioned because it is N-Triples.\n- The version is applied only where a request leaves the app: the REST\n  services, the yasgui headers builders and the export download URL.\n  Callers pass plain media types.\n- Fixed the `text/plain,/;q=0.9` typo in the update query Accept header\n  to `text/plain,*/*;q=0.9`.\n- Fixed the pre-existing lint errors in the touched legacy files, which\n  the pre-commit hook requires. Besides formatting, this replaces two\n  `== null` checks with equivalent strict comparisons.\n\n## Testing\n- Unit tests for `RdfVersionUtil`.\n- New e2e spec `rdf-version-accept-header.spec.js` verifies the exact\n  Accept headers for SPARQL editor queries and downloads, and for graph\n  exports and downloads.","tree":{"sha":"7e29c7d80aabbb1b2777697b7a12cd2b3250208e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/7e29c7d80aabbb1b2777697b7a12cd2b3250208e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGU2OGVkYjYxM2JhNWJjNWQwYThhYzdiNGYxNThlNzM0ZmQzNmY5ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e","sha":"ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e"}],"sha":"e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e68edb613ba5bc5d0a8ac7b4f158e734fd36f982"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:28:01Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:38:32Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-14197: Bump ontotext-yasgui-web-component to 1.8.2\n\n## What\n- Updated `ontotext-yasgui-web-component` to `^1.8.2` in the legacy and\n  the new workbench, and regenerated both lock files.\n- Renamed the encoded triple term constants in `resource.spec.js` to\n  `TRIPLE_RESOURCE_ENCODED` and `LITERAL_TRIPLE_RESOURCE_ENCODED`.\n\n## Why\n- The SPARQL editor needs the YASGUI release with SPARQL 1.2 support.\n- The `_ENCODED` suffix separates the constants from their `_DECODED`\n  counterparts, as requested in review.","tree":{"sha":"8e69a08e7e28c055a56dc90e7830392955572800","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/8e69a08e7e28c055a56dc90e7830392955572800"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGJhNDE4ZWQ5NWI5YzU5MjY5MzYwM2VhYmM0MGMzMzdhOWMwMzA4NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6","sha":"f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6"}],"sha":"ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ba418ed95b9c592693603eabc40c337a9c03084e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:34:31Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:38:32Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-15043 Enable Cypress tests previously marked as skipped (#3235)\n\n## What\nRe-enabled Cypress tests for visual graph, resource view, repository\nmaintenance, and users and access features.\n\n## Why\nThe skipped tests are now valid due to updates in the implementation and\ncompatibility with RDF/SPARQL 1.2.\n\n## How\n- Unskipped all previously marked tests in the E2E legacy test suite.\n- Updated `ontotext-yasgui-web-component` dependency to\n`1.8.0-SPARQL12-TR1` to support the latest SPARQL/RDF 1.2 features.\n- Fixed resource verification logic in `import-server-files.spec.js`.\n- Maintained test reliability by adapting expected behavior to the\nlatest features.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Ubuntu <ubuntu@ip-10-0-141-180.eu-west-1.compute.internal>","tree":{"sha":"508f17f68f009962d39da5162fcc311bbfb2d257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/508f17f68f009962d39da5162fcc311bbfb2d257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGY1MGNhMzk1ZTUwY2E0Nzk1ZDFhOTQyZWYyNDUyNTk5NzE0Njg1YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/3fc7007077d2e0f33fd400c6994437efc2a1683d","sha":"3fc7007077d2e0f33fd400c6994437efc2a1683d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/3fc7007077d2e0f33fd400c6994437efc2a1683d"}],"sha":"f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/f50ca395e50ca4795d1a942ef2452599714685b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/3fc7007077d2e0f33fd400c6994437efc2a1683d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:20:49Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:38:32Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-14206: Update Accept headers to request RDF 1.2 (#3171)\n\n## What\nModified various service files to append version=1.2 to the Accept\nheaders for RDF/SPARQL requests.\n\n## Why\nThis sets the workbench to request version 1.2 regardles of the default\nconfiguration in GraphDB.\n\n## How\n- Updated Accept headers in `rdf4j-rest.service.ts` to include\n`;version=1.2`.\n- Adjusted headers in `yasgui-component.directive.js` for different\nquery types to support versioning.\n- Modified headers in `services.js`, `controllers.js`, and other service\nfiles to append `;version=1.2`.\n- Ensured consistent application of versioning across all relevant\nservice calls.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"cc4d6b99e8351f17747b26e0c7783906929ca97c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/cc4d6b99e8351f17747b26e0c7783906929ca97c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/3fc7007077d2e0f33fd400c6994437efc2a1683d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repo