earch component in the legacy and new workbench\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"fe69852ae87977d0337ed68a60bb20350f475eef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/fe69852ae87977d0337ed68a60bb20350f475eef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/497024c1c9115910cb5c0de07151b147cb51f3af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/497024c1c9115910cb5c0de07151b147cb51f3af","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDQ5NzAyNGMxYzkxMTU5MTBjYjVjMGRlMDcxNTFiMTQ3Y2I1MWYzYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b","sha":"0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b"}],"sha":"497024c1c9115910cb5c0de07151b147cb51f3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/497024c1c9115910cb5c0de07151b147cb51f3af"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:50:21Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-15240 comply with lgpl license\n\n## What\nComply with the LGPL license.\n\n## Why\nTo meet the LGPL-3.0-or-later requirements\n\n## How\nAdded a `license-report-graphwise-reactodia` script that runs `license-checker` against `node_modules/graphwise-reactodia` Registered its report with `MergeJsonPlugin` so it lands in the merged `license-checker.json`, and added a `CopyPlugin` pattern copying `NOTICE`, `COPYING` and `COPYING.LESSER` into `licenses/graphwise-reactodia`. Added a static `@reactodia/workspace` entry to `license-checker-static.json` carrying the LGPL text and the upstream copyright holders, since the bundled library is not reported as a production dependency.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"fb037e987e0787313af38425632e8f812060446c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/fb037e987e0787313af38425632e8f812060446c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDBhZjE1ZGJmZjk3Y2RmYmVkMjYyM2RkZDk3YTIzMzE5Y2QyNTg3NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b","sha":"6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b"}],"sha":"0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0af15dbff97cdfbed2623ddd97a23319cd25874b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T12:57:24Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-15053 configure navigation of RDF search\n\n## What\nConfigure navigation of RDF search based on radio button selection.\n\n## Why\nTo ensure no wrong navigations are made, which are due to the selected radio button type. For example when on the visual graph page and opening a resource, we should only be able to navigate to visual graph and not take into account the currently saved button type, which may be `reactodia`\n\n## How\nUpdated the `$scope.searchType` assignment to check for the presence of `$scope.radioButtons`. If present, it retrieves the search type from `LocalStorageAdapter`, otherwise defaults to `SEARCH_DISPLAY_TYPE.table`.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"22d4dd9fdc88e34dfd8c3720fdd56a97c301e2d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/22d4dd9fdc88e34dfd8c3720fdd56a97c301e2d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDY5ODNjNWQzNGI1ODA5NDA3Y2RiOGJmZDA4NTEzZTQ2NTRiYzcxMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50","sha":"576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50"}],"sha":"6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6983c5d34b5809407cdb8bfd08513e4654bc712b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T06:20:22Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14993 add custom colors per node type\n\n## What\nAdd support for custom colors based on node type in Reactodia.\n\n## Why\nSo they can be styled using the graphwise styleguide\n\n## How\n- Introduced a new `theme` signal to manage color themes.\n- Updated the `reactodia-page.component.ts` to subscribe to theme changes.\n- Modified the `reactodia-component-facade.component.html` and `reactodia-component-facade.component.ts` to pass the `theme` to the `graphwise-reactodia` component.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"e471d11312c236a8e3cf2fb92f1addc526b7a9b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/e471d11312c236a8e3cf2fb92f1addc526b7a9b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDU3NmZiNTc5NWMzZGE0Mjg1MzI5OWMyYWJjYjlkNTllNmJiNjBlNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355","sha":"cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355"}],"sha":"576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/576fb5795c3da42853299c2abcb9d59e6bb60e50"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T11:01:36Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14831 add local store persistence to Reactodia\n\n## What\nAdd local store persistence to Reactodia.\n\n## Why\nThis change improves user experience by ensuring that the diagram state is preserved across page refreshes.\n\n## How\nAdded a subscription to navigation end event in `reactodia-page.component.ts` to clear the diagram state, when a user has navigated away from the view manually. Refreshes preserve the previous diagram\n\n## Testing\ncypress","tree":{"sha":"38a5e18858dc867428f0fb2185887e7ef8b80784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/38a5e18858dc867428f0fb2185887e7ef8b80784"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGNhZTlmNDYxMDE1ZWM4YjNiMzZlM2Q1YzQzZTgwNDc5NmZiYWQzNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/6a53b73464ac839f44e2de98506e123ee4f30264","sha":"6a53b73464ac839f44e2de98506e123ee4f30264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6a53b73464ac839f44e2de98506e123ee4f30264"}],"sha":"cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/cae9f461015ec8b3b36e3d5c43e804796fbad355"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6a53b73464ac839f44e2de98506e123ee4f30264/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T10:49:28Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14785 visualize construct query\n\n## What\nVisualize construct queries with Reactodia.\n\n## Why\nThis feature allows users to visualize the results of SPARQL `CONSTRUCT` queries directly in the Reactodia graph explorer, just like visual graph\n\n## How\n- Added a new `exploreReactodiaYasrToolbarElementBuilder` to create a button for navigating to the Reactodia visualization.\n- Implemented the `navigateToReactodia` method to handle navigation with query parameters.\n- Updated the `config.yasrToolbarPlugins` to include the new toolbar element.\n- Created a new `GraphExploreService` to compute graphs based on SPARQL queries.\n- Introduced `GraphExploreLink` and related models to manage graph data.\n- Updated the `ReactodiaPageComponent` to initialize the graph based on query parameters.\n- Added relevant services\n\n## Testing\njest/cypress","tree":{"sha":"431879132ac83ecb9cf75f9e77a3a7f64f511b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/431879132ac83ecb9cf75f9e77a3a7f64f511b98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/6a53b73464ac839f44e2de98506e123ee4f30264","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signat