,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14784 visualize resource with Reactodia\n\n## What\nVisualize resource with Reactodia.\n\n## Why\nAs part of the ongoing integration of reactodia in the workbench\n\n## How\n- Added a new button for \"Visualize Reactodia\" in `explore.html` which redirects to the reactodia page with a `uri` parameter.\n- Added a new `Reactodia` button to the rdf resource search, which also opens reactodia with the given resource in a new tab (like graph visualization)\n- Updated `reactodia-page.component.ts` to handle query parameters for starting resources.\n\n## Testing\ncypress","tree":{"sha":"daed0940958f5f5fdd0321ee92376ce40e3dad35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/daed0940958f5f5fdd0321ee92376ce40e3dad35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/7c5897e9b5ddced8bd59b33c88a568820e702b0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/7c5897e9b5ddced8bd59b33c88a568820e702b0c","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDdjNTg5N2U5YjVkZGNlZDhiZDU5YjMzYzg4YTU2ODgyMGU3MDJiMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/097e3a09ce7e7d82fa07670e8374d2ffb842d907","sha":"097e3a09ce7e7d82fa07670e8374d2ffb842d907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/097e3a09ce7e7d82fa07670e8374d2ffb842d907"}],"sha":"7c5897e9b5ddced8bd59b33c88a568820e702b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/7c5897e9b5ddced8bd59b33c88a568820e702b0c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/097e3a09ce7e7d82fa07670e8374d2ffb842d907/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T12:38:59Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:08:45Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14755 Create reactodia page\n\n## What\nCreate reactodia page\n\n## Why\nTo implement reactodia as a custom web component inside the workbench\n\n## How\n- Added `reactodia-page.component` which will house the new custom web component wrapper.\n- Added new endpoint which allows a dynamic `accept` header. This is needed by reactodia to make SPQRQL requests using the host http client, also different sparql requests may have different accept headers\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"895a6ddf04e04c5b390d3cb20bb14473c0b55819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/895a6ddf04e04c5b390d3cb20bb14473c0b55819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/097e3a09ce7e7d82fa07670e8374d2ffb842d907","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu