nalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d7cd1b9db75141a603f44ee13770dc760ed3ee85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:01:47Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T12:01:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-15253 Fix alert and warning colors (#3248)\n\n## What\nUpdated CSS variables for warning text and alert components to ensure\nconsistency with the naming convention.\n\n## Why\nThe previous CSS variable names (`--gw-message-warning-color`, etc.)\nwere changed to `*-warn-*`.\n\n## How\n- Replaced `--gw-message-warning-color` with `--gw-message-warn-color`\nfor `.text-warning` and `.alert-warning`.\n- Updated related background and border color variables for\n`.alert-warning`.\n- Adjusted `:before` pseudo-element color to use the updated variable.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"682\" height=\"379\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f6db325-4a64-4a4f-be9a-635bf8ad1d7b\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1181\" height=\"715\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44d8a823-b48c-4699-a062-8024a0a0f39d\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"1c5efce144f2e0e1a7215755198947cedb359fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/1c5efce144f2e0e1a7215755198947cedb359fda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/d7cd1b9db75141a603f44ee13770dc760ed3ee85","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c5efce144f2e0e1a7215755198947cedb359fda\nparent 2f94cf5022cb6c0e7fbef041bec35df563365d37\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1790337707 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790337707 +0000\n\nGDB-15253 Fix alert and warning colors (#3248)\n\n## What\nUpdated CSS variables for warning text and alert components to ensure\nconsistency with the naming convention.\n\n## Why\nThe previous CSS variable names (`--gw-message-warning-color`, etc.)\nwere changed to `*-warn-*`.\n\n## How\n- Replaced `--gw-message-warning-color` with `--gw-message-warn-color`\nfor `.text-warning` and `.alert-warning`.\n- Updated related background and border color variables for\n`.alert-warning`.\n- Adjusted `:before` pseudo-element color to use the updated variable.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"682\" height=\"379\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f6db325-4a64-4a4f-be9a-635bf8ad1d7b\"\n/>\n<img width=\"1181\" height=\"715\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44d8a823-b48c-4699-a062-8024a0a0f39d\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"--