url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/98e5bc496f1726324b7d5c1026b20c35a7dc296a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:36:31Z","email":"svilen.velikov@graphwise.ai","name":"svilen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T08:27:48Z","email":"51084653+svilenvelikov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Svilen Velikov"},"message":"## What\nIntroduce repository picker list component.\n\n## Why\nThis is a component which is accessible on all pages that depend on having an active repository.\n\n## How\nImplemented a repository picker list component that allows the user to select a repository, filter available local or remote repositories or quick access the repository create page.\n\nAdditionally:\n* Added responsive breakpoints and updated media queries in styles\n* Improved the primeng''s link button styling by removing the underline from icons if any\n* Removed the lead class from the alert components in the core-error directive. It enforces a larger font-size and weight which makes everything inside the component bigger and inconsistent. This was probably added by some mistake long time ago.\n* Added a new stateLowercase property to Repository model. This can be used as a marker css class inside templates for example without transformation.\n* Added a section with primeng message components in the ux-test page","tree":{"sha":"15de521b334c6bac7635f0377cc2f70cbe645928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/15de521b334c6bac7635f0377cc2f70cbe645928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/98e5bc496f1726324b7d5c1026b20c35a7dc296a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51084653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/svilenvelikov","id":51084653,"login":"svilenvelikov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDg0NjUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svilenvelikov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/98e5bc496f1726324b7d5c1026b20c35a7dc296a","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDk4ZTViYzQ5NmYxNzI2MzI0YjdkNWMxMDI2YjIwYzM1YTdkYzI5NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29","sha":"0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29"}],"sha":"98e5bc496f1726324b7d5c1026b20c35a7dc296a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/98e5bc496f1726324b7d5c1026b20c35a7dc296a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25177016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brankovanov","id":25177016,"login":"Brankovanov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTc3MDE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brankovanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:20:51Z","email":"georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com","name":"Georgi Brankovanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:20:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-14503: Split ontotext-yasgui-facade component stylesheet (#3239)\n\n## What\n\nSplit the `ontotext-yasgui-facade` (legacy component) stylesheet into\nmultiple smaller files.\n\nSplit the `yasgui-component-facade` (new Angular component) stylesheet\ninto multiple smaller files.\n\n## Why\n\nThe original stylesheets exceed the configured Angular style budget\nduring the Workbench build.\n\nSplitting the styles into smaller, logically grouped files makes the\nstylesheets easier to maintain and keeps the individual component styles\nwithin the configured budget.\n\n## How\n\n### Legacy component — `yasgui-component.html`\n\nSplit the general stylesheet into:\n\n* `yasgui-styles.css`\n* `yasqe-styles.css`\n* `yasr-styles.css`\n* `yasr-tables-styles.css`\n* `dialogs-styles.css`\n* `responsive-styles.css`\n\nUpdated the stylesheet references in `yasgui-component.html`.\n\n### New Angular component — `yasgui-component-facade.html`\n\nSplit the component stylesheet into:\n\n* `yasgui-styles.scss`\n* `yasqe-styles.scss`\n* `yasr-styles.scss`\n* `yasr-tables-styles.scss`\n* `dialogs-styles.scss`\n* `responsive-styles.scss`\n\n## Testing\n\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"8c5fae6fff50cbb736d108c3ed96c3bb25ab163a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/8c5fae6fff50cbb736d108c3ed96c3bb25ab163a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c5fae6fff50cbb736d108c3ed96c3bb25ab163a\nparent b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d\nauthor Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@gmail.com> 1789741251 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789741251 +0000\n\nGDB-14503: Split ontotext-yasgui-facade component stylesheet (#3239)\n\n## What\n\nSplit the `ontotext-yasgui-facade` (legacy component) stylesheet into\nmultiple smaller files.\n\nSplit the `yasgui-component-facade` (new Angular component) stylesheet\ninto multiple smaller files.\n\n## Why\n\nThe original stylesheets exceed the configured Angular style budget\nduring the Workbench build.\n\nSplitting the styles into smaller, logically grouped files makes the\nstylesheets easier to maintain and keeps the individual component styles\nwithin the configured budget.\n\n## How\n\n### Legacy component — `yasgui-component.html`\n\nSplit the general stylesheet into:\n\n* `yasgui-styles.css`\n* `yasqe-styles.css`\n* `yasr-styles.css`\n* `yasr-tables-styles.css`\n* `dialogs-styles.css`\n* `responsive-styles.css`\n\nUpdated the stylesheet references in `yasgui-component.html`.\n\n### New Angular component — `yasgui-component-facade.html`\n\nSplit the component stylesheet into:\n\n* `yasgui-styles.scss`\n* `yasqe-styles.scss`\n* `yasr-styles.scss`\n* `yasr-tables-styles.scss`\n* `dialogs-styles.scss`\n* `responsive-styles.scss`\n\n## Testing\n\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Georgi Brankovanov <georgi.brankovanov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrUjDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9NEQAJeti0AfrtecvRjoXhWsNXZA\nDXxxDnqfIXnhFxI+g41TIplEU3B7OyG6ve+DG6Ma2hZpNEg7IJ2FnvGprDEI88dI\nwhwDMgem3YJJSCre6sDy5MycjaRnLlpYv1ni1nNv5p4l7jfamw26O5CAjnGs+IJF\nqrmKRccWSxCDVZZjKvlHs+4f8WwRTNzzPnLbQlrphYnYCgra56NZOEtR23y9t1Un\n0S1Li5PmgsN1Q6gpdlJtYAQyxsPbQRwkLHUn1vq7dbCp5EWWq1k87G1qXVegDmzd\nyiQfcQwRDq8URM1Aqxr6mac/YceytDoxfOkFu/VdB1n+03YxpimRprdVWmVim6P7\nvtZC3KfcU3PyBgJjW+exMi+DgqkyvgQPbMh73VZe/s8l/5faMrkaWAaSxDF/KfhX\nGo5SHjNn7B4lnnjBGkD7ub0J//KgjV7eQI7wsTM/d9OJ5mCY3QKKMgwH7brgfnt6\npU/IuA4zEoWLmP6OrE0Y+tBVPxlkb4XlHBN91UCfUaoyoc+OGjcNCK0X1xLHCVJS\nNgJo9IKMNXE+uylvoKdl9YndS3AL5oHIcWhqMYjw7hAN3wXw+lnm2ji16sAedsYU\nsXnbK4hEdcGbO3zJy0QGvZoumjt8A5Lll7YqtSvqQg2s/rr0AU3SteU9IwzRoeuz\nGamR9O98pPL9M2pWA4ZF\n=EA1W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T14:20:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDBkNDFlZWQ2MGE4MDYwYTU3N2ZmYzk3NDc3YTAyZGQ1M2M2NDJiMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d","sha":"b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d"}],"sha":"0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/0d41eed60a8060a577ffc97477a02dd53c642b29"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T12:40:44Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:51:39Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14839 remove unnecessary text truncation styles in repository and selector components\n\n## What\nRemove unnecessary text truncation styles in repository and selector components.\n\n## Why\nText truncation styles were causing title misplacement\n\n## How\n- Removed `-webkit-line-clamp`, `text-overflow: ellipsis`, and related properties from `.property-value` in `repository-info-popover.css`.\n- Removed similar styles from `.value` in `onto-repository-selector.scss`.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"a8262c4aca27e1a6c5225ae839e4e0d6124167fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/a8262c4aca27e1a6c5225ae839e4e0d6124167fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGI4Yjc1NmUwMTk3NmY0MzNjOWIxYTRhMjc1OTRmMzFhM2M2NTA4OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474","sha":"d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474"}],"sha":"b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/b8b756e01976f433c9b1a4a27594f31a3c65088d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:12:58Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:01:52Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-15244 Add Slack notifications on failed security test builds\n\n## What\nIntegrated a Slack notification to alert the team when security test builds fail in Jenkins, and fixed failing security test.\n\n## Why\nTo improve team awareness of failed security test builds make it pass.\n\n## How\n- Added `SLACK_CHANNEL` environment variable to `security.Jenkinsfile`.\n- Implemented Slack notification on the `failure` stage using `slack.notifyResult`.\n- Handled errors in Slack notifications gracefully with a `try-catch` block.\n- Removed `cy.presetRepository` call from `user-and-access.spec.js`, as the selected repository parameter was previously removed from the url and is now left in it.","tree":{"sha":"9c5d5daf2caf6b0f301ad6bcbcb177e4ee236632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/9c5d5daf2caf6b0f301ad6bcbcb177e4ee236632"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGQ0ZDRiZTE2MTEwNDY0NjkzMGQ2NjZjNjJjNDU1ZjAyNDBjYTY0NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49","sha":"46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49"}],"sha":"d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d4d4be161104646930d666c62c455f0240ca6474"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T13:00:36Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:54:31Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-14567 show description and hint in graph config tooltips\n\n## What\nExtend graph configuration dropdown tooltips to render HTML content including name, description and hint, and wire tooltip styling through a dedicated tooltip class and updated tooltip container selector.\n\n## Why\nGraph configuration dropdown tooltips previously only showed the name, so the hint and description from the graph configuration were not visible in the tooltip.\n\n## How\n- Updated tooltip container class usage from `.tooltip-box` to `.onto-tooltip-box` because of style leak from `ontotext-yasgui-web-component`.\n- Extended `OntoTooltipConfiguration` (onto-tooltip-configuration.ts) with an optional `tooltipClass` property, and applied it in `TooltipInstance.createFloatingElement` (tooltip-instance.ts) using the new container class.\n- Enhanced `TooltipUtil` (tooltip-util.ts) to read a `tooltip-class` attribute, pass it to the configuration, and to resolve tooltips by the new `.onto-tooltip-box` class.\n- Added `itemTooltipTheme` and `tooltipClass` props to `onto-dropdown` (onto-dropdown.tsx, components.d.ts, readme.md) and propagated `tooltip-class` and item tooltip theme to the dropdown button and items.\n- Updated `onto-repository-selector` (onto-repository-selector.tsx, onto-repository-selector.scss) to style repository tooltips via a `repository-selector-tooltip` class on `.onto-tooltip-box` instead of a theme-only selector.\n- Implemented rich HTML tooltip content for graph configurations in `onto-graph-explore-split-button` (onto-graph-explore-split-button.tsx)\n - Ensured asynchronously resolved dropdown item tooltips are reflected in existing tooltip instances by updating content via `TooltipUtil.updateTooltipContent` and re-dispatching a bubbling `mouseover` event in `setDropdownItemTooltip` (onto-dropdown.tsx). The tooltip was not shown as the event was consumed.\n- Adjusted shared tooltip styling in `onto-tooltip.scss` to use `.onto-tooltip-box`, remove `!important` overrides, add shared shadow and padding, and introduce a `light-border` themed variant using dialog design tokens.\n- Aligned YASGUI tooltip appearance with the shared tooltip style in `yasgui-component-facade.component.scss` and `ontotext-yasgui-web-component.css`.","tree":{"sha":"415b45309192711ad26d04fd5c9091bf1e577b7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/415b45309192711ad26d04fd5c9091bf1e577b7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDQ2YTI1YjA2MDZlODA0NWNiZmI5YjhlOTdlMzQ0ODdlMjU1OGJiNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24","sha":"ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24"}],"sha":"46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/46a25b0606e8045cbfb9b8e97e34487e2558bb49"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T14:31:19Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:05:37Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-15202: Update package dependencies to resolve vulnerabilities\n\n## What\nUpgraded various package dependencies to their latest stable versions in both `package.json` and `package-lock.json`.\n\n## Why\nTo address vulnerabilities identified in outdated dependencies\n\n## How\n- Updated `jsonld` to `^9.0.0` and adjusted its sub-dependencies (e.g., `rdf-canonize`, `@digitalbazaar/http-client`, etc.).\n- Upgraded the `@angular` packages to `^21.2.23` in workbench modules.\n- Updated dependencies such as `colord`, `css-select`, `svgo`, `undici`, and `canonicalize` to their latest versions.\n- Removed deprecated or unnecessary libraries, including `@fastify/busboy`, `node-fetch`, `formdata-polyfill`, and `ky-universal`.\n- Adjusted `package-lock.json` to reflect updates and removed redundant sub-dependencies.\n- Ensured compatibility with Node.js `>=18`.","tree":{"sha":"5e9fb66e31e0e2d661a94111dc1a1e217cdf2e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/5e9fb66e31e0e2d661a94111dc1a1e217cdf2e79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGVmMTUxNDJjNGEyNWE3OTkwOWU4MWY3MjcyZTA2N2U5NDY3YjNjMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7","sha":"4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7"}],"sha":"ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ef15142c4a25a79909e81f7272e067e9467b3c24"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:21:42Z","email":"yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai","name":"Yordan Alexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:13:00Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"message":"GDB-15134: Fix masking of sensitive fields in connector creation\n\n## What\nAdded functionality to toggle masking of sensitive fields during connector creation and query generation.\n\n## Why\nWhen the query is generated to create/clone a connector the fields must not be masked. When the query is used for UI visualization, only then should the query fields be masked.\n\n## How\n- Introduced `maskSensitiveFields` parameter to the `createConnectorQuery` and `toQuery` functions.\n- Updated logic to conditionally mask sensitive fields based on the `maskSensitiveFields` flag.","tree":{"sha":"f16408a26e2e89d8c3ed0b6382fc881b39b8287d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/f16408a26e2e89d8c3ed0b6382fc881b39b8287d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f14f890d7","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDRjZTFjOWI2ZTM3OWQxMGZjNGE0NjY1NjE1ZGM4ZjZmMTRmODkwZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/06696e2f4c256a28d570076844b862404bb301e3","sha":"06696e2f4c256a28d570076844b862404bb301e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/06696e2f4c256a28d570076844b862404bb301e3"}],"sha":"4ce1c9b6e379d10fc4a4665615dc8f6f1