ps://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/ac8479544b458ebc10f3aa663855c2a3a5a77692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/174c9c75cb66ca544c894c11349c9e5a4663637c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:24:46Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:24:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Revert \"GDB-14292 add cypress tests for explain query plan in SPARQL editor (#3216)\n\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n## What\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n\n## Why\nThere are issues with the GDB build due to flakiness of button selection\nas well as difference in deployment. Here we use nginx and mock the llm\nresponse, but GDB doesn''t do that and gets 500, whenever it gets called.\n\n## How\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n## Testing\nn/a\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Plamen Yordanov <plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"6f936615a48d3d89d22b5a7ad79d1859082b5bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/6f936615a48d3d89d22b5a7ad79d1859082b5bec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/174c9c75cb66ca544c894c11349c9e5a4663637c","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f936615a48d3d89d22b5a7ad79d1859082b5bec\nparent 9f9c4ee05ec6c361a38848ad3f4c3ab0e2a27472\nauthor plamen-yordanov <plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com> 1788506686 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788506686 +0300\n\nRevert \"GDB-14292 add cypress tests for explain query plan in SPARQL editor (#3216)\n\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n## What\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n\n## Why\nThere are issues with the GDB build due to flakiness of button selection\nas well as difference in deployment. Here we use nginx and mock the llm\nresponse, but GDB doesn''t do that and gets 500, whenever it gets called.\n\n## How\nRevert commit c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894.\n\n## Testing\nn/a\n\n## Screenshots\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Plamen Yordanov <plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmnI+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh4QQACq+F/LXqKiRKtqlVL6NGxfM\nsmHTZGbwun/qb9+eeO8/8zTWq59uIi/Ihxeezm8mYOs4v383iDLRREg0zweCSqrN\niJCqQkC1Ctr/rm4lAYqQAQcJxgT49rqMXyfh4/PLohl2XghmywiuZ4nsaJiAtzG6\nH7FWU3JLe9qVPCN2z0xgB2UpiKaJJ1jsixyjh4avRqqAq9kymmqYJztJl2cf56IO\noU22LwvtPmys2gHV419DJa3+