a544c894c11349c9e5a4663637c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/174c9c75cb66ca544c894c11349c9e5a4663637c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/9f9c4ee05ec6c361a38848ad3f4c3ab0e2a27472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:10:38Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:10:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-14944 Fix repository edit test flakiness (#3215)\n\n## What\nIntroduced a Cypress spy on repository fetching to ensure consistent\ntest behavior.\n\n## Why\nTests for renaming repositories occasionally failed due to asynchronous\nAPI responses not being properly awaited.\n\n## How\n- Added `spyGetRepository` in `repositories-stubs.js` to intercept\nrepository fetch requests.\n- Integrated a `cy.wait` statement in\n`rename-repository-restrictions.spec.js` to ensure API responses are\nawaited during tests.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"592f1a1e47c3e73e88c5e48d3eaf564cad728e9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/592f1a1e47c3e73e88c5e48d3eaf564cad728e9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/9f9c4ee05ec6c361a38848ad3f4c3ab0e2a27472","verification":{"payload":"tree 592f1a1e47c3e73e88c5e48d3eaf564cad728e9b\nparent e37a50b6d2a3e003368555ec30073b7294378cc5\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788505838 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788505838 +0300\n\nGDB-14944 Fix repository edit test flakiness (#3215)\n\n## What\nIntroduced a Cypress spy on repository fetching to ensure consistent\ntest behavior.\n\n## Why\nTests for renaming repositories occasionally failed due to asynchronous\nAPI responses not being properly awaited.\n\n## How\n- Added `spyGetRepository` in `repositories-stubs.js` to intercept\nrepository fetch requests.\n- Integrated a `cy.wait` statement in\n`rename-repository-restrictions.spec.js` to ensure API responses are\nawaited during tests.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmm7uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAy2gQAJq94EiShobllWUMS5hq3H+f\nOecKvS8u88CCbALPhtHNugfRQ796a7LMEb94lVLATkBVjBRpBF60YWb2HTMlob5H\ncEesBXASwV2LAhUIuLgM4LRBF1HXG6wgFlrJjCNhzaJh4x9bh2RSie1ZqSmmypdc\nv