o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c0de9def649f0daa50d5bdc03664b90057fd70b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:50:54Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:50:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-14848: Remove minimum length constraint for multi-region tags (#3199)\n\n## What\nRelaxed the minimum length constraint for identifier tags in the\nmulti-region directive.\n\n## Why\nThe 3-character limitation was enforced only on the UI, while no such\nrestriction exists in the API. To align the behavior and avoid\nunnecessary restrictions, the UI validation was updated.\n\n## How\n- Changed the `minLen` constraint from \"3\" to \"1\" in the\n`TagLengthConstraints` of the multi-region directive.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"37f1e3bd735af0abb35534a532b3587f51556ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/37f1e3bd735af0abb35534a532b3587f51556ed7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/c0de9def649f0daa50d5bdc03664b90057fd70b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 37f1e3bd735af0abb35534a532b3587f51556ed7\nparent efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788342654 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788342654 +0000\n\nGDB-14848: Remove minimum length constraint for multi-region tags (#3199)\n\n## What\nRelaxed the minimum length constraint for identifier tags in the\nmulti-region directive.\n\n## Why\nThe 3-character limitation was enforced only on the UI, while no such\nrestriction exists in the API. To align the behavior and avoid\nunnecessary restrictions, the UI validation was updated.\n\n## How\n- Changed the `minLen` constraint from \"3\" to \"1\" in the\n`TagLengthConstraints` of the multi-region directive.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql/F+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQmcQALDRQuAMPCbGqSbqjy9XfIgx\nCLfK4FEGqxhbRe4lSg0pdey3oEmft9uS0VQ46tXvH85tqsUTF/8n3b+/QckhPt0J\nN8c0cFCbofXT6ZligA166qwbxlR8yFZe47iKyksfcN3XrA7B9PjcTNd+EwMigzUY\nzvqaUFYe3lHKgtFdIIbRar6FHAc8O6kQQayiYaTRs+v4D4M3sVEKJXAhx6fx5Lg5\n04Ekqnv3L2mVjQZbd9NSr/uz8RWGamutii/meyB3EhmMo1/AkAgir4v2iFrF0z6U\nzlSBfNlXVFBgkotgzqwihAiw2E6J/5RpOFxiWlNjsw5cwbxXAgDX5ILIMQeBJy/0\nVsjki8o6hAlmDnJPpZ+e+SmcyQ13aEhgExSv80yEyvvUUbLe335KFIv7QDOPSrn8\nrMeOu097Uthi6Erb23xlmYkY6dsJr9awsSiXKsw4mQrBz2lzKLnC7qoT6VMz8Y7P\n3UsOp7FsllmaGJD0OTwTeqNjtbFNViuax/IK5Vfz3Vy9dSsm/xAAYc8p25AmGFXH\nIrm/ocKBoPopZiIsc5kT7LicU71aM43fZlA+T+qcPw5lRv7/fSH77O40adSjeirA\nGfUS88Q2pVyrcBAHiTs804c07X9DTylZDh1doe9MD54jjTpSab513Na/WdLZZ23I\nwv7fymgfBk8rV2i1TuZa\n=DNZq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T09:50:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/c0de9def649f0daa50d5bdc03664b90057fd70b4","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGMwZGU5ZGVmNjQ5ZjBkYWE1MGQ1YmRjMDM2NjRiOTAwNTdmZDcwYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093","sha":"efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093"}],"sha":"c0de9def649f0daa50d5bdc03664b90057fd70b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c0de9def649f0daa50d5bdc03664b90057fd70b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:58:26Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:20:04Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14226 update button styles for various states\n\n## What\nUpdate button styles for various states.\n\n## Why\nPrevious styles lacked consistency across hover, focus, active, and disabled states. The changes ensure a unified and accessible design system.\n\n## How\n- Modified CSS variables in `bootstrap-graphdb-theme.css`, `common.css`, and `_button.scss` for primary and secondary buttons.\n- Added styles for `hover`, `focus`, `active`, and `disabled` states in multiple parts of the codebase.\n- Updated individual button components like `onto-search-resource-input.scss` and `shepherd-custom.css` for consistent behavior.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"fbe770f09afb397dd2530cdd1363772145749038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/fbe770f09afb397dd2530cdd1363772145749038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGVmYTY2MjE1M2NiNTgyODFlNWNmYjliMTM1YzY3ODYxOTU5MjgwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894","sha":"c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894"}],"sha":"efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/efa662153cb58281e5cfb9b135c6786195928093"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:09:43Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:02:07Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14292 add cypress tests for explain query plan in SPARQL editor\n\n## What\nadd cypress tests for explain query plan in SPARQL editor\n\n## Why\nThere was a bug in the backend, when running the query. The backend can''t effectively validate it through tests, so we are adding e2e tests to catch potential regression\n\n## How\nAdded `explain-query-plan.spec.js` to validate behavior, including support for query types (SELECT, CONSTRUCT, DESCRIBE) and handling of unsupported types (UPDATE queries, virtual repositories).\nAdded mock for the GDB llm request\n\n## Testing\ncypress","tree":{"sha":"3a65452fdc663038b55f44793e4a0ef04f54e41b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/3a65452fdc663038b55f44793e4a0ef04f54e41b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGM5M2NkMDBkZjU5ZWZmMjlhMGNlMzA1ZDZiOTA5ZmVmMDYyMjc4OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5","sha":"c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5"}],"sha":"c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c93cd00df59eff29a0ce305d6b909fef06227894"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T07:53:37Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:12:22Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-14231 auto expand extraction methods with errors\n\n## What\nAuto expand extraction methods with errors.\n\n## Why\nCollapsed panels made it difficult to identify precondition errors blocking save actions. This change ensures errors remain visible by keeping panels expanded, whenever there are errors.\n\n## How\n- Added `isExtractionMethodPanelLocked()` to prevent collapsing panels with unresolved errors.\n- Implemented `hasPreconditionError()` to check for configuration issues.\n- Created `setPreconditionValidity()` to expand panels and manage form validity when errors are present.\n- Refactored validation key mappings for simplicity and consistency.\n\n## Testing\ncypress","tree":{"sha":"f68d0cac3032171ff02736e7fa65c1e91a75025c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/f68d0cac3032171ff02736e7fa65c1e91a75025c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGMxNmVlMTI1OWI4NDVlMzIzM2M0MjRiMjgzNmYxYjk0YzllN2I1YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/e9340f65803eb1a4d7375334f9d4e16ad7e3eecf","sha":"e9340f65803eb1a4d7375334f9d4e16ad7e3eecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e9340f65803eb1a4d7375334f9d4e16ad7e3eecf"}],"sha":"c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/c16ee1259b845e3233c424b2836f1b94c9e7b5a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/e9340f65803eb1a4d7375334f9d4e16ad7e3eecf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:16:56Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:16:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-14564: Align various upload button icons (#3183)\n\n## What\nUpdated the styles and structure of the various upload buttons in\nrepository creation view for better alignment and visual consistency.\n\n## Why\nTo enhance the user interface by ensuring that the button elements are\nproperly aligned and visually appealing, improving overall user\nexperience.\n\n## How\n- Added a new CSS class `.upload-button` to manage layout and spacing.\n- Updated HTML structure to use the new class for consistent styling\nacross different files.\n- Changed label styles to improve readability and maintain design\nconsistency.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"673\" height=\"145\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b41cc53-b109-4ee6-b3be-065044d0384e\"\n/>\n<img width=\"618\" height=\"311\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be259c10-b4f8-4286-8ce2-0f64ea9603d6\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"d569a6cb37fb86a909d913153a29d548872275f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/d569a6cb37fb86a909d913153a29d548872275f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/e9340f65803eb1a4d7375334f9d4e16ad7e3eecf","verification":{"payload":"tree d569a6cb37fb86a909d913153a29d548872275f1\nparent 9fc6dd7f319d96f692fcfe0538025ebbf1b26017\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787919416 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787919416 +0000\n\nGDB-14564: Align various upload button icons (#3183)\n\n## What\nUpdated the styles and structure of the various upload buttons in\nrepository creation view for better alignment and visual consistency.\n\n## Why\nTo enhance the user interface by ensuring 