 necessary.\n\n## Why\nThis change addresses the need for better security by masking sensitive information in input fields.\n\n## How\nModified the `type` attribute of input fields in `connectorsInfo.html` and `createConnector.html` to conditionally set it to `password` based on the `__sensitive` property.\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"9eb2033a6ea06d7b26a7c99e55462eaeed4d8e20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/9eb2033a6ea06d7b26a7c99e55462eaeed4d8e20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/9fc6dd7f319d96f692fcfe0538025ebbf1b26017","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190497925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/plamen-yordanov","id":190497925,"login":"plamen-yordanov","node_id":"U_kgDOC1rEhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/plamen-yordanov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/9fc6dd7f319d96f692fcfe0538025ebbf1b26017","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKDlmYzZkZDdmMzE5ZDk2ZjY5MmZjZmUwNTM4MDI1ZWJiZjFiMjYwMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/3248c4a3d4be0fe7f277fa6ee4f655ea34b7dced","sha":"3248c4a3d4be0fe7f277fa6ee4f655ea34b7dced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/3248c4a3d4be0fe7f277fa6ee4f655ea34b7dced"}],"sha":"9fc6dd7f319d96f692fcfe0538025ebbf1b26017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/9fc6dd7f319d96f692fcfe0538025ebbf1b26017"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/3248c4a3d4be0fe7f277fa6ee4f655ea34b7dced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:49:03Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:49:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-15106 handle cluster without leader in multi-region tab (#3188)\n\n## What\nHandle clusters without an elected leader in the multi-region\nconfiguration tab and add an informational alert when no topology is\navailable.\n\n## Why\nThe multi-region tab threw \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''topologyStatus'')\" when the cluster had no elected leader due to slow\nloading.\n\n## How\n- Updated multi-region.directive.js to safely set `$scope.topology`\nusing optional chaining when no leader is present and added a debug log\nfor the cluster configuration response.\n- Adjusted multi-region.html to show an info alert when `topology` is\nmissing and guard primary/secondary sections with explicit `topology`\nchecks.\n- Refined layout in multi-region.css to move the height constraint from\nthe container to `.multi-region-content`.\n\n## Testing\nAdded\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"536\" height=\"358\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e298f9a-3419-4980-91a2-52a4bc794df8\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"10ecd1731cc14858022efb50ffd403cfcefc7562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/10ecd1731cc14858022efb50ffd403cfcefc7562"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/3248c4a3d4be0fe7f277fa6ee4f655ea34b7dced","verification":{"payload":"tree 10ecd1731cc14858022efb50ffd403cfcefc7562\nparent 93f3909cb62ad27fc34df4da1cd86b0b6cf2537c\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787842143 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787842143 +0000\n\nGDB-15106 handle cluster without leader in multi-region tab (#3188)\n\n## What\nHandle clusters without an elected leader in the multi-region\nconfiguration tab and add an informational alert when no topology is\navailable.\n\n## Why\nThe multi-region tab threw \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''topologyStatus'')\" when the cluster had no elected leader due to slow\nloading.\n\n## How\n- Updated multi-region.directive.js to safely set `$scope.topology`\nusing optional chaining when no leader is present and added a debug log\nfor the cluster configuration response.\n- Adjusted multi-region.html to show an info alert when `topology` is\nmissing and guard primary/secondary sections with explicit `topology`\nchecks.\n- Refined layout in multi-region.css to move the height constraint from\nthe container to `.multi-region-content`.\n\n## Testing\nAdded\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"536\" height=\"358\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e298f9a-3419-4980-91a2-52a4bc794df8\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkE5fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0V8QAFFd6ayJgR0tCggL+sH6iR5Q\nQGYeAXvL1k7mpWtBmyZh4Pv2ShPxZzYGQ/ylwCUi/aOH8Hhp1c3S5/M1Ky7AxWL2\nDZyo8P+JCnRKDeAldYR7rkYv9/Fgn3xBqGQMKvFV2wEaOrmYfKSAgsgk4bD/YD0R\n3S8Rpu/f8L36tmPOEZsYJxsAYAC+gSzYM2Vb6dQdNETcrs+wz6LTu/gMl45UCAdw\n3oVhvgmVvOtvNE/BoAytWwZpfQ+1dX1NYj23oagdUi0T4KiEPwwAPYI9J86vGcOY\nYuCO8MJ8/YoW9IlaYCGPNmCQsv/ArS0ncTqzL02EhsBF4xCjij1soIxZQ8GFjho6\nO0xVFElTjctcJBdRw1AmUS9w7ySVpPx4US4ydZbRcDwtx6zUj60QQXPqVqsWh3p8\nrrphxs9hO/HE77ekGdYXGAWZuNvg9EdPzqeXEceeczk0OquGJHxFWrlI3Mt21eQX\nCkw+oj15hWpSV0dWF2ayPqPOoiZPoHC3nU1qMc4bAsEryCwRWONiGFei7uzL6+l/\nXVHl3bpVHxlbNGx1FQrTcreWUJuE2c6qeu/u/DbeNzsW4PFyuIr4qD0ssQCbaB2N\n4BVCdVKd/i4tz/twMY9MqE6Rn5p3PmytsZZOX2ozc2R279DH9vGYqGcKPrWyMy23\nGLiDOOfCzAvL+jSXLKjz\n=4e54\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T14:49:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users