64a67f83c06285fbe36","node_id":"C_kwDOC73NI9oAKGQyNjg5NTdhMjgyNzE1MWVmNTVkNjY0YTY3ZjgzYzA2Mjg1ZmJlMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commit/f1f96564d3be4f7847a2e5826b3a9de977c22511","sha":"f1f96564d3be4f7847a2e5826b3a9de977c22511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/f1f96564d3be4f7847a2e5826b3a9de977c22511"}],"sha":"d268957a2827151ef55d664a67f83c06285fbe36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/d268957a2827151ef55d664a67f83c06285fbe36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/f1f96564d3be4f7847a2e5826b3a9de977c22511/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T15:14:31Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@graphwise.ai","name":"Plamen Yordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T08:17:03Z","email":"plamen.yordanov@ontotext.com","name":"plamen-yordanov"},"message":"GDB-13418 sync repository deletion/creation from another tab\n\n## What\nImplement synchronization of repository deletion/creation across different tabs\n\n## Why\nBecause currently there is no such synchronization. When creating/deleting repositories, the changes are not reflected in other tabs from the same origin\n\n## How\n- Added a `BroadcastService` to send `BroadcastChannel` messages to other browser contexts\n- Added `broadcast-message` as a unified model of the message to be sent\n- Added a subscription in the main `controller.js`, which listens for `MessageType.REPOSITORIES_UPDATED` and triggers `$repositories.init()`\n- Added event dispatch on create/delete repository actions\n\n## Testing\nn/a","tree":{"sha":"7aebf5f395270a4cf9e848cc403997a4c9c9613b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/7aebf5f395270a4cf9e848cc403997a4c9c9613b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/f1f96564d3be4f7847a2e5826b3a9de977c22511","verification":{"payload":nul