s://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/6acf41e4482a410f323406f5f21181fd26ac428b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:52:43Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T06:52:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"GDB-14472 Move TTYG menu item to root level (#3186)\n\n## What\nMove Talk to your graph menu item from Lab to root level under SPARQL\nitem. It is no longer an experimental feature. Hide the Lab menu item\nparent.\n\n## Why\nThe Talk to your graph feature has evolved and does not need to be in\nthe Lab section anymore. The Lab section now containing no items should\nbe hidden.\n\n## How\n- Updated `main-menu-steps.js` to click on the new root-level menu item.\n- Modified `plugin.js` to update the menu item''s properties and remove\nits parent reference.\n- Removed \"Lab\" from the locale files (`locale-en.json` and\n`locale-fr.json`).\n- Adjusted `main.js` to reorganize the menu items and ensure proper\ndisplay.\n- Updated `graphdb-workbench-plugins` with the change of the menu steps\n\n## Testing\nAmended tests\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"284\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10abb9f5-d542-45b5-bf2e-bac5bbab9e81\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"44af037347201cc293ba3030e1730d47705c962e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/44af037347201cc293ba3030e1730d47705c962e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/6acf41e4482a410f323406f5f21181fd26ac428b","verification":{"payload":"tree 44af037347201cc293ba3030e1730d47705c962e\nparent dfb93645514f8937e077f147baaab396ef478a6a\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787813563 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787813563 +0300\n\nGDB-14472 Move TTYG menu item to root level (#3186)\n\n## What\nMove Talk to your graph menu item from Lab to root level under SPARQL\nitem. It is no longer an experimental feature. Hide the Lab menu item\nparent.\n\n## Why\nThe Talk to your graph feature has evolved and does not need to be in\nthe Lab section anymore. The Lab section now containing no items should\nbe hidden.\n\n## How\n- Updated `main-menu-steps.js` to click on the new root-level menu item.\n- Modified `plugin.js` to update the menu item''s properties and remove\nits parent reference.\n- Removed \"Lab\" from the locale files (`locale-en.json` and\n`locale-fr.json`).\n- Adjusted `main.js` to reorganize the menu items and ensure proper\ndisplay.\n- Updated `graphdb-workbench-plugins` with the change of the menu steps\n\n## Testing\nAmended tests\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"284\" height=\"767\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10abb9f5-d542-45b5-bf2e-bac5bbab9e81\"\n/>\n\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj967CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsbUQAHZA78KxWktJCTagu6oIf2N1\nlTwZZ1yzT5l1chof+ttRI3it6hoFTTxVxqqEMT1/l44jBN0TRtfyectMN4wJhUMH\nd3IavG1j/egsomV5zMj62OWCY25ctSn0FX3iyaDkge95zaPLD9pv8itzVHUIKEpI\nVWMKgdXef+UjAbfrBWjZ8Vmn6Y/rUEtzIDAVOT/Z5vWU3H1tT+D7puU+mGgrltQ7\njSCcm1RLCHSUsdUJvA0RACufEbg6fTdh7XfoJFM5RKSqv+GfUV/2umNWdTL1m1V8\n/xlpK2e1Zxn5IQnrCc8ePLNHIPPVrF/wiOUOGzycsGI95kkxKDn7mFUdhTodFJEw\nxRm5Q3tDwlHqgZEscH/3zZetbUcHVSdT5C0IBN5J/3X1UHKU+usllP48T+2PAiSl\nejwP4sgGoTwsoPTas1Z1TEJafb5w6T00Fp2Zb8uqAFQBwFdZt02l/mWItFZ5vuP7\n/qvwEeHEBq1gUcoErlcaT9jIcWge3A5GdPg6UZKYUpIjjlP97i/OpiwfwSJCDBft\nbon76f1+RggXuIhw4+JU0u50Q870A8VE3lCMpRMD8BZ6KVVNVxVZjhN+VlnOyQ20\ng6bYITayCEwaJ2lQga+Yuv2j/vTG4/8wbHw07f4h/vsc5KkpQ0B7PDSzWDGzX5Ze\n3EQTDiNGLYyTLe9yvXjs\n=33RG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T06:52:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","ur