orkbench/commits/8dbf86a7ff31166447029e30ad75fa77432e891b"}],"sha":"dfb93645514f8937e077f147baaab396ef478a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/dfb93645514f8937e077f147baaab396ef478a6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72871803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yordanalexandrov","id":72871803,"login":"yordanalexandrov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODcxODAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yordanalexandrov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/commits/8dbf86a7ff31166447029e30ad75fa77432e891b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:51:21Z","email":"72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YAlexandrov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:51:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improve NPM authentication error handling in Jenkinsfile (#3184)\n\n## What\nEnhanced the error message for NPM authentication failure in the release\nJenkinsfile.\n\n## Why\nTo provide clearer feedback when NPM authentication fails, helping\ndevelopers quickly identify issues with the NPM_TOKEN.\n\n## How\n- Updated the shell command to output a specific error message when `npm\nwhoami` fails.\n- Added an exit code to ensure the build process stops on authentication\nfailure.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","tree":{"sha":"6b7e4773a81662e68bee0ca35bd5fa0969a18d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/trees/6b7e4773a81662e68bee0ca35bd5fa0969a18d25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ontotext-AD/graphdb-workbench/git/commits/8dbf86a7ff31166447029e30ad75fa77432e891b","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b7e4773a81662e68bee0ca35bd5fa0969a18d25\nparent 9cd057acf9e9bcf71f77c23fd2f761b0ac66fd6d\nauthor YAlexandrov <72871803+yordanalexandrov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787651481 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787651481 +0000\n\nImprove NPM authentication error handling in Jenkinsfile (#3184)\n\n## What\nEnhanced the error message for NPM authentication failure in the release\nJenkinsfile.\n\n## Why\nTo provide clearer feedback when NPM authentication fails, helping\ndevelopers quickly identify issues with the NPM_TOKEN.\n\n## How\n- Updated the shell command to output a specific error message when `npm\nwhoami` fails.\n- Added an exit code to ensure the build process stops on authentication\nfailure.\n\n## Testing\n\n## Screenshots\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Branch name\n- [x] Target branch\n- [x] Commit messages\n- [x] Squash commits\n- [x] MR name\n- [x] MR Description\n- [ ] Tests\n- [ ] Browser support verified\n\nCo-authored-by: Yordan Alexandrov <yordan.alexandrov@graphwise.ai>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjWWZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA61gQAGDNOjzdyXq9qGmAnWRO3GIU\nOmWQg1cja3joGpFt/ot/Cfj0wX15t/ShpdlrVgYKcXjm0jCo/W+ZM3RsGeZyhg+4\n7zorC+S2tgostzsdNwMsMOxqt8Se0Hw7J/D94xIHASfg3MZpyf