seRequest(manual) + useEffect[detail?.userId] 触发 refetch\n- Modal 底部加 \"同作者的其他资讯\" 段,点击切换 detail\n- 用 <mark> 语义化标签(屏幕阅读器友好,样式自定义)\n- 不使用 dangerouslySetInnerHTML(防 XSS),走 split + JSX 数组映射安全路径\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b52fa4cc233dbbd1bd6e7a7ec47738f6ea17424b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/trees/b52fa4cc233dbbd1bd6e7a7ec47738f6ea17424b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/commits/646586c2070c75999c86b98991fc5b8c80cc1fac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26790619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Langery","id":26790619,"login":"Langery","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzkwNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Langery/Electron_text/commit/646586c2070c75999c86b98991fc5b8c80cc1fac","node_id":"C_kwDOC97qMdoAKDY0NjU4NmMyMDcwYzc1OTk5Yzg2Yjk4OTkxZmM1YjhjODBjYzFmYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Langery/Electron_text/commit/e5f83d438e2da8a86aea0e3967479162b1dc203f","sha":"e5f83d438e2da8a86aea0e3967479162b1dc203f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/e5f83d438e2da8a8