ps://api.github.com/users/Langery/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Langery","id":26790619,"login":"Langery","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzkwNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/76e4d22618186fc41326865fe19174e81c8ca572/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T00:35:55Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T00:35:55Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"message":"feat: T-A — dragpage InfoPage 真正实现(从 9 行 stub 到完整详情面板)\n\n原来 InfoPage 只接收 isShow 布尔 prop,内容永远硬编码 \"Info Page\nContent\"。点击右侧拖入组件时面板会\"显示\"但无任何真实信息。\n\n三处联动改:\n- InfoPage 接收 item prop,null 渲染 Empty,非空按 source 分发到\n  LibraryDetail(显示年龄/昵称/添加时间,绿 Tag)/ MenuDetail(图标/\n  info/编号,蓝 Tag)\n- dragpage 用 selectedItem 替代 isInfoShow 状态机(2 布尔 → 1 nullable)\n- SumSide 的 onGetShow(boolean) → onSelectItem(item),handleClick 改\n  高阶(item => () => onSelectItem(item))\n\ninfoipage.less 加详情面板布局(border/padding/label-value 行)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"487c379c38be9ac63af19bcc4d3f3493363edb4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/trees/487c379c38be9ac63af19bcc4d3f3493363edb4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/commits/76e4d22618186fc41326865fe19174e81c8ca572","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26790619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Langery","id":26790619,"login":"Langery","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzkwNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Langery/Electron_text/commit/76e4d22618186fc41326865fe19174e81c8ca572","node_id":"C_kwDOC97qMdoAKDc2ZTRkMjI2MTgxODZmYzQxMzI2ODY1ZmUxOTE3NGU4MWM4Y2E1NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Langery/Electron_text/commit/74c527e6ce97a32c18358d04d69cc9358354f624","sha":"74c527e6ce97a32c18358d04d69cc9358354f624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/74c527e6ce97a32c18358d04d69cc9358354f624"}],"sha":"76e4d22618186fc41326865fe19174e81c8ca572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/76e4d22618186fc41326865fe19174e81c8ca572"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26790619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Langery","id":26790619,"login":"Langery","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzkwNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/74c527e6ce97a32c18358d04d69cc9358354f624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:22Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:23:22Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"message":"refactor: S-B — 3 站点改用 useLocalStorage(删 4 个 read/persist 副本)\n\nchartxkcd / libraryOverview / dragpage(2 个 key) 共 4 个 useState\nread pattern 全部切到 S-A 的 useLocalStorage hook:\n\n- 删 4 个 read/persist 工具函数(readCandidateLibrary ×3,\n  persistCandidateLibrary ×1, readDragLayout ×1, persistDragLayout ×1)\n- dragpage handleDrop 内 persistCandidateLibrary 删(setter 自动写)\n- dragpage clearLibrary / clearLayout 删 persist 调用\n- dragpage saveLayout 改\"force flush\" no-op,消息改\"已自动保存\"\n- chartxkcd / libraryOverview 解构 [value, , refresh] 跳过未用 setter\n\ndragLayout 从\"显式 save\"变 autosave,按钮保留 UI 行为但语义\n改变 —— 实际收益:消除\"忘保存 → 关页面 → 改动丢失\" footgun。\n\nM 组多页签上线后,storage 事件自动让 mainpage tab 的写入同步\n到 dragpage / chartxkcd / libraryOverview,无需手动刷新。\n\n净删 ~70 行,vite build ✓,JS bundle 1,474.66→1,474.51 kB。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae5516f24a8eb8021b5c6460c8b45155ce855c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/trees/ae5516f24a8eb8021b5c6460c8b45155ce855c19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/commits/74c527e6ce97a32c18358d04d69cc9358354f624","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_ur