NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/commits/b51d010af62a5cac4d275154a641d431a2f49a92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:18:30Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T05:18:30Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"message":"feat: S-A — useLocalStorage hook 抽取(autosave + 跨 tab 同步)\n\n代码 review 指出 localStorage 消费模式重复 3 次(readCandidateLibrary\n在 chartxkcd/dragpage/libraryOverview 各一份),M 组多页签上线后\n跨 tab 数据不同步。抽 hook 统一。\n\n数组元组返回 [value, setValue, refresh]:\n- setValue 支持函数式更新(同 useState),自动写 localStorage\n- useEffect 注册 storage 事件,跨 tab 同步\n- defaultValue 用 useRef 锁定,避免 caller 字面量 [] 污染依赖\n- storage 事件不在写方触发(浏览器标准行为),同 tab 不竞态\n\nS-B 重构 3 站点后才有真实运行时收益,本次只动 hook。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d9a5366a4202af60686facb5ac6762e4ad04dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/trees/3d9a5366a4202af60686facb5ac6762e4ad04dd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/commits/b51d010af62a5cac4d275154a641d431a2f49a92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26790619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/