gery"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:54:36Z","email":"1245066197@qq.com","name":"Langery"},"message":"fix: K组 阶段F — operation.less 字体改回 antd 默认\n\n删 font-family: \"Bookman old style\",让 antd .ant-btn 默认字体级联生效。\n\nBookman Old Style 是衬线字体,跟 antd 默认无衬线差异大,可能是\n\"+ 图标 + Bookman 文字\" baseline 错位的真凶。\n\n删整行而不是改值,是因为这是 override,删了后级联自然找到 .ant-btn 默认。\n4 按钮统一改字体(方案 C 的固有代价),换一次性\"全局 baseline 修正\"。\n\n详细见 Markdown/修改内容.md K 组 阶段F 条目。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc45da602e910ad143c75ec71f096118791a237d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/trees/cc45da602e910ad143c75ec71f096118791a237d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Langery/Electron_text/git/commits/18a33f6c9627781e9eb7b7c8dc79fda9134bd764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26790619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Langery","id":26790619,"login":"Langery","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzkwNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Langery","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Langery/Electron_text/commit/18a33f6c9627781e9eb7b7c8dc79fda9134bd764","node_id":"C_kwDOC97qMdoAKDE4YTMzZjZjOTYyNzc4MWU5ZWI3YjdjOGRjNzlmZ