?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vitorrgg","id":35348281,"login":"vitorrgg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzQ4Mjgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/commits/47406872e811a54fc853c74e1a83a86db1d6ec6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:40:55Z","email":"35348281+vitorrgg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Rocha Gonçalves"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:40:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(checkout): return to identification when the session token is rejected (#1314)\n\n* fix(checkout): return to identification when the session token is rejected\n\n`EcCheckout.login()` set `customerEmail` (and so `isUserIdentified`) as soon\nas the passport cookie had an `auth.id`, before `fetchCustomer` confirmed the\nsession. `checkLogin()` does not validate the token, so an expired token led\nto 401 on `/customers/:id`, `ecomPassport.logout()`, and a checkout stuck on\nthe AccountForm with e-mail only, as if the customer were new: returning\ncustomers re-registered and orders created duplicated customers.\n\nNow the buyer is identified only once the account is loaded, via the\n`customer.main_email` watcher, and `Checkout.login()` resets the account\nstate when the fetch fails with the session dropped, so the LoginBlock stays\nand picks the `login` event when the token is renewed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(checkout): trim comments on login fetch handling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Leonardo Matos <leomp120894@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"024baa77234f1152ab7fe2e3b92226a9c1293e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/trees/024baa77234f1152ab7fe2e3b92226a9c1293e41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/commits/47406872e811a54fc853c74e1a83a86db1d6ec6b","verification":{"payload":"tree 024baa77234f1152ab7fe2e3b92226a9c1293e41\nparent f5974cc749bbbf65dfdf7aed039a6d4f508d7a9d\nauthor Vitor Rocha Gonçalves <35348281+vitorrgg@users.noreply.github.com> 1790016055 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790016055 -0300\n\nfix(checkout): return to identification when the session token is rejected (#1314)\n\n* fix(checkout): return to identification when the session token is rejected\n\n`EcCheckout.login()` set `customerEmail` (and so `isUserIdentified`) as soon\nas the passport cookie had an `auth.id`, before `fetchCustomer` confirmed the\nsession. `checkLogin()` does not validate the token, so an expired token led\nto 401 on `/customers/:id`, `ecomPassport.logout()`, and a checkout stuck on\nthe AccountForm with e-mail only, as if the customer were new: returning\ncustomers re-registered and orders created duplicated customers.\n\nNow the buyer is identified only once the account is loaded, via the\n`customer.main_email` watcher, and `Checkout.login()` resets the account\nstate when the fetch fails with the session dropped, so the LoginBlock stays\nand picks the `login` event when the token is renewed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(checkout): trim comments on login fetch handling\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Leonardo Matos <leomp120894@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsXo3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaVwQAGtlT3WY/eMJjam0X1iDmHcX\nfpyWgC2OJGj0Erbd6TgUayiFyattHUoBlf5jmKefk8xFky/z0bMwJuXF5/maq1wn\nAAoghzPnk9ZVdA7ZWuELRihxAQx4cH7taY1W9BHKztSwUUQgE/5XyNoEMj61exFn\n7QVGCwRWQ4e+SsvwNQ2YEuSnwyQG/le9s4f8zO+zing+sp88V8EtkG19pvf+ywnk\naL/TIwWxBQJ7BDp5nPkaimsmZyVg2EEeJJ+8Tpc2iAXMmyz7pdNdIWr9NMbDt4rW\ndgVAodrr4A7d91wcJPk4h9I+Rea+qMJ2kMGLZNMACQIPGvezgxE+Ygzwu8TOPuP4\n2ypZnfmDQ1U6pBfaTjWhgp4mEB7zdZCHqSZhb02tNymCu60UIEve44OJwyj2e1vJ\nTbMDQwERZfcXuZsAGhaxhkhKGesh8OxIQGckdEcy2S/p+AN/zmJkCv/+sDvoLH/m\ntxf2Q4YdJ3gd1QFwx788clHe3IsBhB/P6TeS/xPLd9GodfYtiaJsU4eAzuvaNj/I\nyVRi3bb94ImskH6e810UR30JLek6Ga4s2TWi30q/lYl96U4ceF0QeZRpdXzvH65t\n6f6h6mT3cjlN3tawEG31AZOl9EqRPjZCg3zs1zzZBjfjAKExo6HonccMK9z6cfgI\n2ivYmZINk+Ihh1X3e6eo\n=Wf1j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T18:40:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a