.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/commits/e41a967a313d48d3a83230a02fe93768fb885650"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35348281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vitorrgg","id":35348281,"login":"vitorrgg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzQ4Mjgx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorrgg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/commits/36c860795899dbc5e1bc1d44eec3c51786266a77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T00:58:23Z","email":"35348281+vitorrgg@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vitor Rocha Gonçalves"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T00:58:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Card doctype (#1282)\n\n* fix(widget-tag-manager): send price fields as float to GTM dataLayer\n\nGoogle Ads rejects string values in cart data fields (price, revenue,\nshipping, tax), causing \"Item price formatted incorrectly or missing\"\nerrors. Wrap .toFixed(2) calls with parseFloat() to ensure numeric types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(credit-card-form): allow CPF or CNPJ regardless of customer registry type\n\nAdd allowBoth prop to InputDocNumber so the credit card holder doc field\naccepts free input (no forced mask). Document type is inferred by digit\ncount at submit time: 11 digits = CPF, 14 digits = CNPJ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(credit-card-form): make allowBoth doc opt-in via window flag\n\nAdd cardDocAllowBoth prop to CreditCardForm defaulting to\nwindow.ecomCreditCardDocAllowBoth === true, keeping the original\nmask-by-registry-type behavior unless explicitly opted in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Vitor <ti@e-com.club>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Leonardo Matos <leomp120894@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b807dedd563df5384326ba9bffa2bffea05e23be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/trees/b807dedd563df5384326ba9bffa2bffea05e23be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/commits/36c860795899dbc5e1bc1d44eec3c51786266a77","verification":{"payload":"tree b807dedd563df5384326ba9bffa2bffea05e23be\nparent 4607255fb7d0ccd73a09766d142ca26af381ac15\nauthor Vitor Rocha Gonçalves <35348281+vitorrgg@users.noreply.github.com> 1781657903 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781657903 -0300\n\nCard doctype (#1282)\n\n* fix(widget-tag-manager): send price fields as float to GTM dataLayer\n\nGoogle Ads rejects string values in cart data fields (price, revenue,\nshipping, tax), causing \"Item price formatted incorrectly or missing\"\nerrors. Wrap .toFixed(2) calls with parseFloat() to ensure numeric types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(credit-card-form): allow CPF or CNPJ regardless of customer registry type\n\nAdd allowBoth prop to InputDocNumber so the credit card holder doc field\naccepts free input (no forced mask). Document type is inferred by digit\ncount at submit time: 11 digits = CPF, 14 digits = CNPJ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(credit-card-form): make allowBoth doc opt-in via window flag\n\nAdd cardDocAllowBoth prop to CreditCardForm defaulting to\nwindow.ecomCreditCardDocAllowBoth === true, keeping the original\nmask-by-registry-type behavior unless explicitly opted in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Vitor <ti@e-com.club>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Leonardo Matos <leomp120894@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMfEvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb5AQAEUTSyZU+7TdKJpjWILucjsc\nz9hkQil9B1SnS2r+TuWoOiy16r4ExBH9+utd6lmmdH4RAXT36ap7K+lWzR9w9tG6\nEOnQM+vHOVQGM1kYAHbwM0iujiNX8s9r2mP7A4THFtoSMmM5KerHYeWTXepSl4Y9\naFofz4UBrWz+OBLUFNImc9iUqzxuUf6yEI1SvG1FhaFSIZdMMqBi5xrBqlRiKapV\nU0CCUxgvIVjvhwqvoJDp9A15CZSmKPHH067Dg7xPd8y82K2hbLui2aQJBbnmdj7s\nrMhsID83TDypv1FM2OHYsoUFXVRiiKav4d8mjNHDyDVCR6nPf+DnMzqOJc+eVL/b\nv8tNOO0Vf11fz4eYHDbTLL/eaic5fo2AMm1MWjtf1uPoMvg2aot8G02le5GzrlrT\nd8dP2mLTAjpXWzKv5/SZ624q81JfxFta9kOyTTqKpwbB2TWTmI3m9mHb/qepwKPQ\nzHGgsdJuDXm+e38SY+RniqmKkzpjg3u9yAU+Vl1i309hytG3D/gzeuAjg6bpgwIl\nqJLQ07IxedeER+5LK3OAXyI55RRv2bVpAgJLQWtrzFWOgWAyA8J+719SelF66+/0\nr6R9j/XxDpt2z9P861sc0WZ/xql7jdPAx4mZkxd2V5aGd+H9O5tYJ/UQPDCkbpZQ\ntxEqKKajb3v4mzEMWaK4\n=M3j7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-17T00:58:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":fal