hored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7b8e4b3e415397ecfa7c8343e091ec6b5af0b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/trees/a7b8e4b3e415397ecfa7c8343e091ec6b5af0b02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ecomplus/storefront/git/commits/12a65a2c337df54f09f566964779a9ce66fa25d7","verification":{"payload":"tree a7b8e4b3e415397ecfa7c8343e091ec6b5af0b02\nparent 5eb6ef83f32a07f694b01a1848148c798f49c527\nauthor Vitor Rocha Gonçalves <35348281+vitorrgg@users.noreply.github.com> 1776397018 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776397018 -0300\n\nfix(widget-tag-manager): send price fields as float to GTM dataLayer (#1255)\n\nGoogle Ads rejects string values in cart data fields (price, revenue,\nshipping, tax), causing \"Item price formatted incorrectly or missing\"\nerrors. Wrap .toFixed(2) calls with parseFloat() to ensure numeric types.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vitor <ti@e-com.club>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4araCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuUAQABLzdv+IDmnaarWcc7lf+pj0\n7SrfQzyBdk9I6He+HuXBZvjfxtTLQxsqYpxOuDQCjiucrjnY3p+/TI0iB4ICp4QF\nHS+GtQcLxaMUL+MXwQtwtupatOax8/+Wy+6gCnOC6ViCpvAJv9JvJOleZW86mbkl\nW7D6GsZtFG3aQNe37B2WbYZtmdteOXDXLcKsjpF8Mg8WB4DcFwtf8fEuFAGUwxgu\nG1X+AQ/Fvc8Jl7sqPuy1VMEoagOR9kVJE/hDN+tH8oO9t+DVDsfFfYemNgsFmfu1\nCpYzn1PM+FgAwYLTjAPAzPdsRqIfo0/f4cGWUvs/N8IX4Gnm/wjt/giGLSPzViEg\ntC9t8MZXSc5DF4f2cHu1RXNszgZs6Ducgu+0uzWEoQ2wRyANevmRwLbPBMnGsf1g\nnp03Pt7GGWv65xcL5DbzPiYaT4Bw/EwRiN1WwJPWOVaodIOBfQ63YwtpQh/Wzfwt\nrZxqzV2b6TYK9df5MEmCtk2U8PTVlGwKFe1flUsDmCLFBtC4iLYQX0PamuuYJn+2\nvwBO70EcAyMw5y5UEJW3P0etFPpCpF42vUtPTrwHJ2d3ODPwpq5ms/GResHrqoNg\nQLkARC79XXPVzBAXaCcfs+p9ci7Pf9vx45l5M2o55iJFX0rL3pKhaiO9iOkN7lF1\n5uwk3Bs/SfkwC72tqSl1\n=byPk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-17T03:36:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"