s/elevatebart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/0e7d0cc9471511f956266e084a7280d157660d47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:58:31Z","email":"bledoux@kestra.io","name":"Barthélémy Ledoux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:58:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(flows): playground run saves a draft instead of publishing (#20370)\n\nCloses https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra-ee/issues/11369.\n\nRun task in the Playground saves unsaved edits as a draft and runs it,\nso production keeps the last published revision. A new flow is saved as\na draft without the confirm dialog, and the playground stays on after the\nredirect. Flows created as drafts now report FLOW_CREATED with is_draft.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TAeCXxAQmk9wJNMeJsazPu","tree":{"sha":"f51c2edffb149cc97de459655cd48607914a6877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/trees/f51c2edffb149cc97de459655cd48607914a6877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/commits/0e7d0cc9471511f956266e084a7280d157660d47","verification":{"payload":"tree f51c2edffb149cc97de459655cd48607914a6877\nparent 7767d411ead2baf9cb640ea907e5a31ebc1f77d3\nauthor Barthélémy Ledoux <bledoux@kestra.io> 1791212311 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791212311 +0200\n\nfix(flows): playground run saves a draft instead of publishing (#20370)\n\nCloses https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra-ee/issues/11369.\n\nRun task in the Playground saves unsaved edits as a draft and runs it,\nso production keeps the last published revision. A new flow is saved as\na draft