fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/cdf4c28c054cb888dadd0693532ddfa001776fd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15046814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AcevedoR","id":15046814,"login":"AcevedoR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDQ2ODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/709a557f4eb2582149db75cd9c200d58b6af1a01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:38:32Z","email":"roman.acevedo62@gmail.com","name":"Roman Acevedo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:21:07Z","email":"roman.acevedo62@gmail.com","name":"Roman Acevedo"},"message":"fix(executions): retry a failed WorkingDirectory child by running its WorkingDirectory again\n\nWhen a child of a WorkingDirectory failed and had a retry (its own, a parent''s or the flow''s), the executor\nretried the child alone: it was dispatched as a standalone task, outside the working directory, while the\nworker had already stopped running the WorkingDirectory at the failure. The children after it were never\ncreated, so the WorkingDirectory, its execution and its concurrency slot stayed RUNNING forever.\n\nThe retry now targets the WorkingDirectory: its task run is delayed and marked RETRYING, the attempts are\ncounted on it, and retryTask drops its children so the next run creates them again.","tree":{"sha":"720e933b1dd838e18b679ca2a66b6edd20dab806","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/trees/720e933b1dd838e18b679ca2a66b6edd20dab806"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/commits/709a557f4eb2582149db75cd9c200d58b6af1a01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15046814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AcevedoR","id":15046814,"login":"AcevedoR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDQ2ODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AcevedoR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/commit/709a557f4eb2582149db75cd9c200d58b6af1a01","node_id":"C_kwDODCtNAdoAKDcwOWE1NTdmNGViMjU4MjE0OWRiNzVjZDljMjAwZDU4YjZhZjFhMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/commit/9d8e72633ecea9533446f12e581c991db981ee91","sha":"9d8e72633ecea9533446f12e581c991db981ee91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/9d8e72633ecea9533446f12e581c991db981ee91"}],"sha":"709a557f4eb2582149db75cd9c200d58b6af1a01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/709a557f4eb2582149db75cd9c200d58b6af1a01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182117439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thebhavye","id":182117439,"login":"thebhavye","node_id":"U_kgDOCtrkPw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebhavye","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/9d8e72633ecea9533446f12e581c991db981ee91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:19:37Z","email":"bhavye.kathuria2024@vitstudent.ac.in","name":"Bhavye Kathuria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:19:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(flow): preserve metadata for failed flows (#19814)\n\n* fix(execution): store Loop and LoopUntil sub-taskruns inside execution statistics\n\nFixes https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/17806 and https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/17808\n\n* fix(execution): revert loop statistics on restart\n\n* fix(core): preserve metadata for failed flows\n\n* fix(core): preserve metadata for failed flows, reuse label deserializer\n\nRemoves unrelated loop-statistics changes and reuses ListOrMapOfLabelDeserializer via ObjectMapper.convertValue() for labels preservation.\n\n* fix(core): handle null labels in failed flows\n\n* chore(core): clarify malformed label handling\n\n* fix(core): preserve labels for failed flows\n\n* fix(core): preserve variables for failed flows when available\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Loïc Mathieu <loikeseke@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5b6f8cf8d8fa4101bee65bccb33c33f6314edb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/trees/f5b6f8cf8d8fa4101bee65bccb33c33f6314edb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/commits/9d8e72633ecea9533446f12e581c991db981ee91","verification":{"payload":"tree f5b6f8cf8d8fa4101bee65bccb33c33f6314edb9\nparent 2bcd2ea58d8cf1dc9d844ac20e7b540997214cf9\nauthor Bhavye Kathuria <bhavye.kathuria2024@vitstudent.ac.in> 1791199177 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791199177 +0200\n\nfix(flow): preserve metadata for failed flows (#19814)\n\n* fix(execution): store Loop and LoopUntil sub-taskruns inside execution statistics\n\nFixes https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/17806 and https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/17808\n\n* fix(execution): revert loop statistics on restart\n\n* fix(core): preserve metadata for failed flows\n\n* fix(core): preserve metadata for failed flows, reuse label deserializer\n\nRemoves unrelated loop-statistics changes and reuses ListOrMapOfLabelDeserializer via ObjectMapper.convertValue() for labels preservation.\n\n* fix(core): handle null labels in failed flows\n\n* chore(core): clarify malformed label handling\n\n* fix(core): preserve labels for failed flows\n\n* fix(core): preserve variables for failed flows when available\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Loïc Mathieu <loikeseke@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw4fJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr9gQAJT174NiyKkdDZtNZhw8TRCa\n+kNqRuSsDPCOxCNBJpWx9m3O21ofxTFlvYsq5E6C4m+AyZkm1eKdCcUDBZX9ffhP\n5KLlsEXP78rdPF9+hW1F5wG76sSCU1RrxvHtj2+Xu/x+q54ua+RrwIXXxlirRzcP\nqCX/SLySeL20vDUZzCQddyuR9DssdZ40KX3RSSSOKTyXovLEFgw8fPvqqCv3/mUW\nTIoYvjMP5/654AY5mtbkR3FW+5Nxxwb31By5Y2me/BdpxgTzO5dzkKi6m