paces`, `NamespaceIterator.fetchCall` and `defaultNamespace`: the fetch size and options reaching the iterator and the store call, a missing `total` coerced to 0, a real `total` passed through, and the stored or `null` default namespace.\n\nCloses https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/20197.\nRelated to https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra/issues/19824.\n\nCo-authored-by: MilosPaunovic <paun992@hotmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw4XbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA09YQAC6AYLzdIXmzCsK76zdKr18t\nNX4q4tKvisDkIdUdjrJpGD6EefTxnNfsXK5UgepVBSjxL/tjTr1TATAdujdsaMiY\nTLgeKZ7cbyZrT5Bx3+jDPvX+U/DPdPsISnfXCsyLdY/i6eM02cL/b5mQMemtJHqB\nZImYhnrkcuMRtWVqZ+2Nj57DEDIg1Acwd0cQtAZKBSL/vQpwtLaQzvriyBvdH5t0\nNxON5OP/Gsd/isUvLgvXAbErUhzWGfvVsLT8o0AsuOVeavQrLgyABco+lP/nQXzw\nhv98EM70efU2KPkPTd1qefbrc5HuUbE4+A0VZzfGOzi3IbEn4A8bBHWGcK36dvoZ\no6M+o45Mj1VaviaatyiqvGrSKnEhv1HnMSJIH2ukp0MndZ+DoKEIRB3FpU0llaUH\nQP8TH6s7Nb+KHQ6IzL1oP/rFodAmbiZlr0y1B0qurh6gTxHuYrHbgWvCV7L1X0WK\nkN/AcsOutm0GdQ+ca/IRxR26yPs51U8odEKkp7/JJx0Pm2P7AOs5EB/e9nA88USn\n4UzILfeWlj7HiiruTXQ1gm7xKCIGYqfSWAq99erIW6QgTnzhfhr3OWtvV0NDHEyg\n9T8kW/DMZRzNjVEEfWFT2cjy7Pwq4qVF/hivUW4zz7tAFls04oYFVggRgtBF+oGo\n2uoy0q4YKr+VaTYAEWcT\n=zPDC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T11:11:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo