vatebart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elevatebart","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/commits/81491d2162c24a2d99cef9c211ea2a3b4c636538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:05:42Z","email":"bledoux@kestra.io","name":"Barthélémy Ledoux"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:05:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(iam): re-authentication dialog on 401, unreachable server banner (#20076)\n\nA 401 on a logged-out session now opens a re-authentication dialog and replays the failed request after sign-in, instead of dropping the user on the login page with their unsaved work gone. A Kestra API call that gets no response raises a banner once the failure lasts 2s. Fetch/XHR 401s no longer carry WWW-Authenticate: Basic, so the browser''s native dialog stays out of the way.\n\nCompanion: https://github.com/kestra-io/kestra-ee/pull/11442\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQuc98xQgSW7MmQk5NYzko","tree":{"sha":"63d267fdee10fd82014fa1c0188f11729d692443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/trees/63d267fdee10fd82014fa1c0188f11729d692443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kestra-io/kestra/git/commits/81491d2162c24a2d99cef9c211ea2a3b4c636538","verification":{"payload":"tree 63d267fdee10fd82014fa1c0188f11729d692443\nparent e44129d4a402a2c21b4639965a5321086fc3aa9f\nauthor Barthélémy Ledoux <bledoux@kestra.io> 1791194742 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791194742 +0200\n\nfeat(iam): re-authentication dialog on 401, unreachable server banner (#20076)\n\nA 401 on a logged-out session now opens a re-authentication dialog and replays the failed request after sign-in, instead of dropping the user on the login page with their unsaved work gone. A Kestr