},"message":"feat: fetch site language list from the LMS released_languages endpoint (#713)\n\nReplace the hardcoded TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES array in the header''s site\nlanguage selector with a call to GET /api/lang_pref/v1/released_languages\n(edx/edx-platform#478). The modal fetches the list the first time it opens,\nshows a spinner while loading and an error alert on failure, and drops beta\nlanguages (released: false) since the header has no way to label them.\nsetSiteLanguage() now validates against the fetched list instead of the\nconstant.","tree":{"sha":"aac70d4d6592ce61cfc0d33cc7def980554fc386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edx/frontend-component-header-edx/git/trees/aac70d4d6592ce61cfc0d33cc7def980554fc386"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edx/frontend-component-header-edx/git/commits/9279a3ef40c5c81010d3a5e6265ecf91f355755d","verification":{"payload":"tree aac70d4d6592ce61cfc0d33cc7def980554fc386\nparent 7dca572f0be77d8154a1ec8a4e633c7ce5b4f204\nauthor Aditya Bhalsod <abhalsod-sonata@2u.com> 1789733026 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789733026 +0530\n\nfeat: fetch site language list from the LMS released_languages endpoint (#713)\n\nReplace the hardcoded TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES array in the header''s site\nlanguage selector with a call to GET /api/lang_pref/v1/released_languages\n(edx/edx-platform#478). The modal fetches the list the first time it opens,\nshows a spinner while loading and an error alert on failure, and drops beta\nlanguages (released: false) since the header has no way to label them.\nsetSiteLanguage() now validates against the fetched list instead of the\nconstant.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrSiiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhDYQAIR7Mp+iicBKHblUfK17oF3b\nVF7JswuMA8fAunr97LvRZfnOPvHdBC7c3Yfz28Z8DMfAHdI3UbNMEfnQjUz1XV09\nSVgm7S05r5FeGa+T9+JxQMNEcyW/Acz2SVXAG9EPogz4YtnlsjpoAlaxDmOaHCzf\nhGmQrX+yqzB6QgIw7Q40P3mQz4RYlZ9PvaWQR2YAcP/ECusYbF6PAlan11KKhuY7\nWh7KXSQ+IMgY+Z7VUHwBBaLMTkgWgI