unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T09:00:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add V2 of header actions slot (#682)\n\nIntroduce a v2 version of LearningHeaderActionsSlot that always mounts,\nwrapping the existing v1 slot (HeaderNotificationsSlot and\nLearningHelpSlot) which stays gated behind showUserDropdown. This\npreserves the v1 slot API contract for existing plugin consumers while\nallowing new plugins to attach to v2 unconditionally.\n\nNote: HeaderNotificationsSlot/LearningHelpSlot remain hidden when\nshowUserDropdown is false. Fully decoupling them from showUserDropdown\nrequires deprecating v1 first, and is left for a\nfollow-up once the DEPR lands.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Arunmozhi <arunmozhi@opencraft.com>","tree":{"sha":"b94f83a90a15d120e10763ec83c0a5c558f58f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-component-header/git/trees/b94f83a90a15d120e10763ec83c0a5c558f58f83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-component-header/git/commits/922e3672c5858a985344e9592f26235c56074bfd","verification":{"payload":"tree b94f83a90a15d120e10763ec83c0a5c558f58f83\nparent 046f2cdc106b5703e46e1cd3523b61709efa769b\nauthor Chris Chávez <xnpiochv@gmail.com> 1789808426 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789808426 -0300\n\nfeat: Add V2 of header actions slot (#682)\n\nIntroduce a v2 version of LearningHeaderActionsSlot that always mounts,\nwrapping the existing v1 slot (HeaderNotificationsSlot and\nLearningHelpSlot) which stays gated behind showUserDropdown. This\npreserves the v1 slot API contract for existing plugin consumers while\nallowing new plugins to attach to v2 unconditionally.\n\nNote: HeaderNotificationsSlot/LearningHelpSlot remain hidden when\nshowUserDropdown is false. Fully decoupling them from showUserDropdown\nrequires deprecating v1 first, and is left for a\nfollow-up once the DEPR lands.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Arunmozhi <arunmozhi@opencraft.com>","reason":"valid","sig