users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/62e4df1015fa21686c0c17ecd10249cbdf70a5d0","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKDYyZTRkZjEwMTVmYTIxNjg2YzBjMTdlY2QxMDI0OWNiZGY3MGE1ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5","sha":"c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96","sha":"c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96"}],"sha":"62e4df1015fa21686c0c17ecd10249cbdf70a5d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/62e4df1015fa21686c0c17ecd10249cbdf70a5d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:35:26Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:35:26Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"message":"Point the upgrade guide at the released SDK instead of the beta\n\nThe guide told integrators to align on `8.0.0-beta.11`, in the version\ntable and again in the dependencies section. That version is gone from the\nworkspace and from the lockfile, so the advice pointed at a prerelease\nnobody should install.\n\nIt also now says what SDK 8 asks of anyone building their own client: the\nbuild is version-aware, `apiVersion` is required, and it becomes part of\nthe request URL. The accepted values and the migration path are spelled\nout, along with the fact that these components pin `2026-05` internally so\nthe option is not something the reader has to pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51f533cb845dc0073ec10570b01490c3c66a5719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/trees/51f533cb845dc0073ec10570b01490c3c66a5719"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/commits/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKGM5MjRhNzhiOGI4MzZkOWMxZmMzNDE3MTRmYWMwZjYyYmU5MTZkOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1","sha":"6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1"}],"sha":"c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/c924a78b8b836d9c1fc341714fac0f62be916d96"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:34:45Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:34:45Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"message":"Update the SDK to 8.0.2 and pin the API version it now requires\n\n`8.0.0-beta.11` was a legacy SDK build: `API_SUPPORTED_VERSIONS` was empty,\nso `ApiVersion` resolved to `never`, the `apiVersion` init option could only\nbe omitted, and requests went to the unversioned `/api/...`.\n\n`8.0.2` is a version-aware build. `API_SUPPORTED_VERSIONS` is\n`[\"2017-08\", \"2026-05\"]`, the option is required, and its value becomes a\npath segment - `/api/2026-05/sku_lists`. Without it the build fails with\nTS2345: \"Property ''apiVersion'' is missing ... but required\".\n\nThe whole workspace initialises the client in one place, `getSdk` in\ncore-components, so the version is pinned there behind a named constant.\n`2026-05` is the schema the shipped types are generated from\n(`API_SCHEMA_VERSION`), so it is the only value that leaves the responses\nand the types describing the same API. The spec asserts it, so it cannot\nchange without a failing test.\n\nNothing else needed changing. The typecheck reports the same 27 errors as\n`main`, none new. The 10 extra errors seen before rebuilding were the\nsibling packages'' stale `dist/`, still carrying the beta types, and\n`pnpm build` cleared all ten.\n\nThe one behaviour the versioned path does change is what a sales channel\ntoken may do, which is why the SKU list fixture moved to integration\ncredentials in the commit before this one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"830a7d469d2669885ac80a3c718872bc89eda2f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/trees/830a7d469d2669885ac80a3c718872bc89eda2f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/commits/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKDZkMmRjN2M0OWFkZjJlMjAwOTNjMDkwNTNlMTVkYmY3NWFjMDE0YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72","sha":"eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72"}],"sha":"6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/6d2dc7c49adf2e20093c09053e15dbf75ac014b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:33:55Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:33:55Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"message":"Look the SKU list fixture up with credentials allowed to list\n\n`sku-lists-container.spec.tsx` needs a SKU list id before it can exercise\nthe container, and it was asking for one with the sales channel token the\ncomponents themselves run on.\n\nThat listing is not something a storefront token is entitled to. On the\nlegacy unversioned API it was allowed and came back empty, so the fixture\nquietly handed the specs an empty id and they asserted against a container\nthat had nothing to retrieve.\n\nThe id now comes from a confidential integration token. The credentials\nwere already in `.env` as `VITE_TEST_CLIENT_ID_INTEGRATION` and had never\nbeen used by anything, and `getToken` grows an `integration` type to reach\nthem. Only the fixture uses it: the components under test still render on\nthe sales channel token, which is what a storefront has.\n\nMeasured against the API with one sales channel token, so that the split is\non record rather than assumed:\n\n| request | sales channel | integration |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /sku_lists` | 401 UNAUTHORIZED | 200, 1 element |\n| `GET /sku_lists/<id>?include=skus` | 200 | 200 |\n\nThe retrieve is what `SkuListsContainer` actually performs, and it is\npermitted. It was only ever the listing that was not.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7a21a2c0e1445951b7ff1653642a49971d419c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/trees/a7a21a2c0e1445951b7ff1653642a49971d419c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/commits/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKGVlYTFiOTBmYmM0NmM3MWM3ZjI3YzAwOTEyMzIxOTZkOTg2NGFiNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5","sha":"c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/c4138e8f4e6cd1726fd06577d7ccc2b4ece61bf5"}],"sha":"eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/eea1b90fbc46c71c7f27c0091232196d9864ab72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55532305?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://