/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f","sha":"f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f"}],"sha":"59cae3f6b882e9982e2f65f4305c81a12f2e0c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/59cae3f6b882e9982e2f65f4305c81a12f2e0c73"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/3966b59cd74286bc567d9299d6dd91104fa56cb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:24:40Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:24:40Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"message":"docs(getting-started): add the v4 to v5 upgrade guide\n\nCovers the four changes that actually break a v4 app — the React 19 peer\nbump, the removal of the 20 subpath exports in favour of a single root\nentry, `<CommerceLayer>` losing `endpoint` and `domain` now that the\norganization is derived from the token, and the sibling packages, where a\ndirect dependency on core-components or react-hooks-components shadows the\ntransitive one and leaves two incompatible copies in the tree.\n\nThen the full table of the 15 deprecated containers and their standalone\nreplacements, split between straight renames and the ones that dissolve by\nmoving their props onto the children. `<AddressesContainer>` gets its own\nexample, since its props split across two forms.\n\nNo export was removed from the public API in v5, so the guide leads with\nthe two-stage upgrade: get the app running first, clear the deprecation\nwarnings later. The concept behind the container removal already lives in\n`005.containers.mdx`, so this page links there rather than restating it,\nand the same for the core and hooks package pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9b866bb814fe4dea470db6b250ec2d193d31784","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/trees/f9b866bb814fe4dea470db6b250ec2d193d31784"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/commits/3966b59cd74286bc567d9299d6dd91104fa56cb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/3966b59cd74286bc567d9299d6dd91104fa56cb2","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKDM5NjZiNTljZDc0Mjg2YmM1NjdkOTI5OWQ2ZGQ5MTEwNGZhNTZjYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a","sha":"a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a"}],"sha":"3966b59cd74286bc567d9299d6dd91104fa56cb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/3966b59cd74286bc567d9299d6dd91104fa56cb2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:00:27Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:00:27Z","email":"acasazza@commercelayer.io","name":"Alessandro Casazza"},"message":"chore: bump pnpm to 11.24.0\n\nThe root `packageManager` field is the single source of truth for the pnpm\nversion: Netlify reads it via Corepack (it has no PNPM_VERSION variable) and\n`pnpm/action-setup` resolves it there, since the workflows pass no `version`\ninput. Bumping it here moves both at once. The lockfile stays at\nlockfileVersion 9.0, unchanged across pnpm 11.x.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9276d4f274b4ae43238859f62bc314f03e3bee4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/trees/9276d4f274b4ae43238859f62bc314f03e3bee4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/git/commits/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f","node_id":"C_kwDODH1HQdoAKGY5ODA4NGJkNTgwNTBlMjcwMWQ4NTk2NWE0NjM0ZTkxMDMyNjMzMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commit/a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a","sha":"a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/a67d0ff34b837e93cb9f3cd11e3e97a37af7823a"}],"sha":"f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commercelayer/commercelayer-react-components/commits/f98084bd58050e2701d85965a4634e910326330f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55532305?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/acasazza","id":55532305,"login":"acasazza","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NTMyMzA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acasazza/starr